#. ~ Item name
#: items/forged_guts_sword.json
msgid "Forged Guts' Sword"
msgid_plural "Forged Guts' Swords"
msgstr[0] "仿·格斯之剑"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/forged_guts_sword.json
msgid ""
"This massive blade is your painstaking attempt to recreate Guts' legendary "
"sword, whispered about among survivors. Forged from hardened steel, it is "
"almost like the weapon said to have cut through dragons and apostles—if "
"those stories were true. Heavy, crude, and sharp, it reaches far and hits "
"hard: perfect for zombies or something worse."
msgstr ""
"这柄巨刃是你凭幸存者的传闻，尽力复刻格斯传奇之剑的成果。高碳钢锻成，若那些屠龙斩使徒的故事是真的，它倒也颇有几分相像。沉、糙、利，挥击又远又狠——对付丧尸或更糟的东西都合适。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/true_guts_sword.json
msgid "Guts' True Sword"
msgid_plural "Guts' True Swords"
msgstr[0] "真·格斯之剑"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/true_guts_sword.json
msgid "In Guts' hands, this massive blade handles as if it were much lighter than its size suggests, even when wielded with one hand. It was made to hew enemies apart, embodying strength and determination worthy of a legendary weapon."
msgstr "在格斯手中，这柄巨剑挥舞起来远比外观看着轻巧，即使只用一只手也能使用。它为斩裂敌人而生，凝聚着配得上传奇武器的力量与决心。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/nosferatu_zodd_sword.json
msgid "Nosferatu Zodd's Sword"
msgid_plural "Nosferatu Zodd's Swords"
msgstr[0] "不死者佐德之剑"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/nosferatu_zodd_sword.json
msgid ""
"A colossal sword wielded by the fearsome Nosferatu Zodd. Forged in a brutal "
"style reminiscent of Kushan craftsmanship, it cleaves flesh and bone with "
"ease. Only the mightiest can wield it effectively."
msgstr "骇人的不死者佐德所使的巨剑。锻造风格凶悍，近似古式匠艺；切肉断骨毫不费力。只有最强者才配真正驾驭它。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/void_crystal.json
msgid "Void Crystal"
msgstr "虚空水晶"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/void_crystal.json
msgid "A dark crystal radiating a faint energy, left behind by Apostle Void."
msgstr "一枚幽暗的水晶，微微散发能量，为虚空使徒所留。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_helmet.json
msgid "Berserker Helmet"
msgstr "狂战士头盔"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_helmet.json
msgid "A heavy helmet that awakens fury and weighs on the wearer's mind."
msgstr "一顶沉重的头盔，唤醒怒火，也逐渐侵蚀佩戴者的心智。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_chestplate.json
msgid "Berserker Chestplate"
msgstr "狂战士胸甲"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_chestplate.json
msgid "A massive chestplate that turns pain into power."
msgstr "厚重的胸甲，用痛苦换取更强的力量。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_gloves.json
msgid "Berserker Gloves"
msgstr "狂战士手套"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_gloves.json
msgid "Gloves that clench your fists with furious strength."
msgstr "将双拳箍进狂暴力量的手套。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_armguards.json
msgid "Berserker Armguards"
msgstr "狂战士臂甲"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_armguards.json
msgid "Armguards that protect your arms and feed your rage."
msgstr "护臂双臂，亦助长怒火。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_legguards.json
msgid "Berserker Legguards"
msgstr "狂战士腿甲"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_legguards.json
msgid "Legguards that grant endurance as the armor's curse takes hold."
msgstr "赋予耐力的腿甲，盔甲的诅咒也随之逐渐侵蚀心智。"

#. ~ Item name
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_boots.json
msgid "Berserker Boots"
msgstr "狂战士战靴"

#. ~ Item description
#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_boots.json
msgid "Boots that trample enemies at the cost of exhaustion."
msgstr "踏碎敌人、也耗尽穿戴者的战靴。"

#. ~ Item name
#: monsterdrops/griffith_drops.json
msgid "Apostle Shard"
msgstr "使徒碎片"

#. ~ Item description
#: monsterdrops/griffith_drops.json
msgid ""
"A jagged fragment torn from an otherworldly being, pulsing with dark energy."
msgstr "锯齿状的碎片，脉动着黑暗能量，从异界生物身上剥落。"

#. ~ Item name
#: monsterdrops/beast_drops.json
msgid "Tainted Flesh"
msgstr "污秽血肉"

#. ~ Item description
#: monsterdrops/beast_drops.json
msgid ""
"A revolting lump of dark flesh that pulses faintly. It looks dangerous to "
"eat."
msgstr "一块令人作呕的暗色肉块，微微搏动。看起来不宜食用。"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/berserk_pursuer.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "(BERSERK) Immortal Zodd"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】不死者佐德"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/berserk_pursuer.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "(BERSERK) Immortal Zodd"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】不死者佐德"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/berserk_pursuer.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You awaken in a dark forest, where Nosferatu Zodd's heavy footsteps and roar"
" already echo through the trees. The legendary apostle has hunted you from "
"the very beginning. This is more than survival—it is a duel in which every "
"second may be your last. Can you escape his crushing blows, lure him into a "
"trap, or face him with nothing but strength and cunning? Prepare for a "
"battle against a demon more powerful than anything in this ruined world."
msgstr ""
"你置身幽暗森林，沉重脚步与不死者佐德的咆哮已在林间回荡。这位渴求战斗的传奇使徒，从一开始就在猎杀你。这不仅是求生——而是一场赌命的决斗，每一秒都可能是最后一秒。你能靠策略躲开他的毁灭性打击、设伏诱敌，还是凭力量与狡诈正面对决？准备迎接一场史诗般的恶战吧——他的威能远超你在这崩坏世界中所见的一切。"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/berserk_pursuer.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You awaken in a dark forest, where Nosferatu Zodd's heavy footsteps and roar"
" already echo through the trees. The legendary apostle has hunted you from "
"the very beginning. This is more than survival—it is a duel in which every "
"second may be your last. Can you escape his crushing blows, lure him into a "
"trap, or face him with nothing but strength and cunning? Prepare for a "
"battle against a demon more powerful than anything in this ruined world."
msgstr ""
