#. ~ Scenario start location name
#: scenarios/berserk_pursuer.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "In the forest"
msgstr "森林中"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/berserk_griffith_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "(BERSERK) Confrontation with Griffith"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】与格里菲斯的对决"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/berserk_griffith_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "(BERSERK) Confrontation with Griffith"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】与格里菲斯的对决"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/berserk_griffith_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You stand in a dark forest, its silence broken only by rustling leaves and "
"heavy breathing. Reborn Griffith appears before you—a beautiful yet "
"terrifying white-winged being whose icy gaze cuts straight through you. This"
" is a fateful encounter with his dark power. His aura of terror weighs upon "
"you, but you are ready to fight with strength and will. Prepare to face a "
"demonic leader more powerful than anything in this ruined world."
msgstr ""
"你站在幽暗森林里，只有叶沙沙声与粗重呼吸打破寂静。重生格里菲斯现身眼前——白翼华美而可怖，冰冷目光直刺心底。这是命运般的正面相遇，你将向他的黑暗力量发起挑战。恐惧与威压扑面而来，但你仍准备凭力量与意志一战。准备迎战这位魔性领袖——他的力量超越你在这崩坏世界中所见的一切。"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/berserk_griffith_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You stand in a dark forest, its silence broken only by rustling leaves and "
"heavy breathing. Reborn Griffith appears before you—a beautiful yet "
"terrifying white-winged being whose icy gaze cuts straight through you. This"
" is a fateful encounter with his dark power. His aura of terror weighs upon "
"you, but you are ready to fight with strength and will. Prepare to face a "
"demonic leader more powerful than anything in this ruined world."
msgstr ""
"你站在幽暗森林里，只有叶沙沙声与粗重呼吸打破寂静。重生格里菲斯现身眼前——白翼华美而可怖，冰冷目光直刺心底。这是命运般的正面相遇，你将向他的黑暗力量发起挑战。恐惧与威压扑面而来，但你仍准备凭力量与意志一战。准备迎战这位魔性领袖——他的力量超越你在这崩坏世界中所见的一切。"

#. ~ Scenario start location name
#: scenarios/berserk_griffith_confrontation.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "In a dark forest"
msgstr "幽暗森林"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/skull_knight_encounter.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "(BERSERK) Encounter with the Skull Knight"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】骷髅骑士之遇"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/skull_knight_encounter.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "(BERSERK) Encounter with the Skull Knight"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】骷髅骑士之遇"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/skull_knight_encounter.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You find yourself in a wasteland surrounded by darkness and the ruins of an "
"ancient castle. Heavy breathing and ringing metal approach from afar. The "
"Skull Knight appears before you, a warrior in armor radiating dark power. "
"His magical attacks and mounted charge threaten your life. Prepare to battle"
" this legendary being with strength and ingenuity."
msgstr ""
"你来到一片荒原，四野昏沉，古堡废墟散落四周。远处传来沉重呼吸与金属撞击——骷髅骑士现身，黑甲战士周身萦绕黑暗之力。魔法攻击与骑乘冲锋皆能取你性命。在这崩坏世界里，凭力量与机智，准备与这位传奇存在展开史诗之战。"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/skull_knight_encounter.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You find yourself in a wasteland surrounded by darkness and the ruins of an "
"ancient castle. Heavy breathing and ringing metal approach from afar. The "
"Skull Knight appears before you, a warrior in armor radiating dark power. "
"His magical attacks and mounted charge threaten your life. Prepare to battle"
" this legendary being with strength and ingenuity."
msgstr ""
"你来到一片荒原，四野昏沉，古堡废墟散落四周。远处传来沉重呼吸与金属撞击——骷髅骑士现身，黑甲战士周身萦绕黑暗之力。魔法攻击与骑乘冲锋皆能取你性命。在这崩坏世界里，凭力量与机智，准备与这位传奇存在展开史诗之战。"

#. ~ Scenario start location name
#: scenarios/skull_knight_encounter.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "Ruined wasteland"
msgstr "崩坏荒原"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/void_apostle_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "(BERSERK) Confrontation with Apostle Void"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】对决虚空使徒"

#. ~ Scenario name
#: scenarios/void_apostle_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "(BERSERK) Confrontation with Apostle Void"
msgstr "【剑风传奇】对决虚空使徒"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/void_apostle_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You stand in a dark, distorted dimension where the air trembles with psychic"
" energy. Apostle Void appears before you, his exposed brain radiating power "
"capable of twisting reality. His gaze pierces the soul and his aura crushes "
"the will. Prepare to confront this demonic leader with endurance and cunning"
" in a nightmare made real."
msgstr ""
"你站在黑暗扭曲的维度中，空气因灵能而颤动。虚空使徒现身——裸露的脑颅下，力量操纵现实。目光刺入灵魂，威压碾压意志。在这噩梦之境，凭韧性与狡智，准备与这位魔性领袖一战。"

#. ~ Scenario description
#: scenarios/void_apostle_confrontation.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You stand in a dark, distorted dimension where the air trembles with psychic"
" energy. Apostle Void appears before you, his exposed brain radiating power "
"capable of twisting reality. His gaze pierces the soul and his aura crushes "
"the will. Prepare to confront this demonic leader with endurance and cunning"
" in a nightmare made real."
msgstr ""
"你站在黑暗扭曲的维度中，空气因灵能而颤动。虚空使徒现身——裸露的脑颅下，力量操纵现实。目光刺入灵魂，威压碾压意志。在这噩梦之境，凭韧性与狡智，准备与这位魔性领袖一战。"

#. ~ Scenario start location name
#: scenarios/void_apostle_confrontation.json
msgctxt "start_name"
msgid "Distorted dimension"
msgstr "扭曲维度"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects_on_condition.json
msgid "Heavy footsteps draw near..."
msgstr "沉重脚步正在逼近……"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects_on_condition.json
msgid "The darkness within the armor comes alive and lunges at you!"
msgstr "盔甲内的黑暗苏醒，向你扑来！"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects_on_condition.json
msgid "Reborn Griffith appears in a flare of dark power!"
msgstr "重生格里菲斯在黑暗力量中现身！"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Reborn Griffith stands before you—his wings gleam and his gaze is cold with "
"resolve. The second encounter has begun!"
msgstr ""
"重生格里菲斯现身眼前，\n"
"白翼闪耀，目光冷峻。\n"
"第二次相遇开始了！"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects_on_condition.json
msgid "Poison from the Beast of Darkness' flesh courses through you!"
msgstr "黑暗恶魔的血肉之毒正在侵蚀你！"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects/void_apostle_eoc.json
msgid ""
"Apostle Void emerges from the warped air, his brain pulsing with energy!"
msgstr ""
"扭曲的空气中浮现虚空使徒，\n"
"裸露的脑颅脉动着能量！"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects/skull_knight_eoc.json
msgid ""
"An unnatural darkness surrounds you, and monsters emerge from the shadows!"
msgstr ""
"暗之存在包围了你，\n"
"魔物从阴影中现身！"

#. Player message in EoC
#: effects/skull_knight_eoc.json
msgid ""
"The Skull Knight steps from the shadows, his armor clanking and his aura "
"terrifying!"
msgstr ""
"骷髅骑士从阴影中走出，\n"
"甲胄铿锵，威压逼人！"

#. Monster name
#: monsters/nosferatu_zodd.json
msgid "Nosferatu Zodd"
msgid_plural "Nosferatu Zodds"
msgstr[0] "不死者佐德"

#. Description of monster
#: monsters/nosferatu_zodd.json
msgid ""
"An enormous armored demon known as Nosferatu Zodd. This apostle possesses "
"inhuman strength and an insatiable lust for battle. His body is covered in "
"battle scars, and his eyes burn with the fire of war."
msgstr "身披铠甲的巨硕恶魔，人称不死者佐德。这位使徒拥有非人之力与对战火的渴求；躯体布满战痕，双眼燃烧着战争之火。"

#. Monster name
#: monsters/griffith_reborn.json
msgid "Reborn Griffith"
msgid_plural "Reborn Griffiths"
msgstr[0] "重生格里菲斯"

#. Description of monster
#: monsters/griffith_reborn.json
msgid ""
"A beautiful winged being with an icy gaze. His presence inspires terror, and"
" his movements are lightning-fast."
msgstr "白翼华美、目光冰冷的存在。其威压令人战栗，动作快如闪电。"

#. Monster name
#: monsters/mon_skull_knight.json
msgid "Skull Knight"
msgid_plural "Skull Knights"
msgstr[0] "骷髅骑士"

#. Description of monster
#: monsters/mon_skull_knight.json
msgid ""
"A mysterious warrior in skull-like armor, wielding magical power and riding "
"a faithful steed. He attacks with grim resolve."
msgstr "神秘战士，骷髅形甲胄，身怀魔法，坐骑忠诚。以阴沉决意发起攻击。"

#. Monster name
#: monsters/mon_void_apostle.json
msgid "Apostle Void"
msgid_plural "Apostles Void"
msgstr[0] "虚空使徒"

#. Description of monster
#: monsters/mon_void_apostle.json
msgid ""
"A mysterious apostle with an exposed brain who radiates a sinister power. "
"His psychic attacks and manipulation of reality inspire terror."
msgstr "脑颅裸露的神秘使徒，散发幽暗力量；心灵攻击与扭曲现实令人胆寒。"

#. Monster name
#: monsters/beast_of_darkness_1.json
msgid "Beast of Darkness"
msgid_plural "Beasts of Darkness"
msgstr[0] "黑暗恶魔"

#. Description of monster
#: monsters/beast_of_darkness_1.json
msgid ""
"A black shadow entity with burning eyes, embodying the dark power of the "
"Berserker Armor. It thirsts for the blood of its host."
msgstr "黑色影形，双眼燃火，是狂战士甲黑暗之力的化身；渴求穿戴者的鲜血。"

#. Name of effect
#: effects/berserk_effects.json
msgid "Berserker Armor Activation"
msgstr "狂战士甲激活"

#. Description of effect
#: effects/berserk_effects.json
msgid "The dark power of the Berserker Armor flows through you."
msgstr "狂战士甲的黑暗力量在你体内涌动。"

#. Apply message of effect
#: effects/berserk_effects.json
msgid "You feel the armor's dark energy awaken."
msgstr "你感到盔甲中的黑暗能量正在苏醒。"

#. Name of a spell
#: spells.json
msgid "Rend Space"
msgstr "空间裂斩"

#. Description of spell
#: spells.json
msgid "A magical strike that deals damage within a 3-tile radius."
msgstr "魔法打击，对半径 3 格内造成伤害。"

#. Name of a spell
#: spells.json
msgid "Aura of Despair"
msgstr "绝望光环"

#. Description of spell
#: spells.json
msgid "A chilling aura that briefly stuns nearby enemies within a 3-tile radius."
msgstr "寒冷光环，短暂震慑半径 3 格内的敌人。"

#. Name of a spell
#: spells.json
msgid "Aura of Behelit Consumption"
msgstr "贝黑莱特吞噬光环"

#. Description of spell
#: spells.json
msgid "Weakens enemies within a 5-tile radius, briefly stunning them."
msgstr "削弱半径 5 格内的敌人，造成短暂震慑。"

#. Name of a spell
#: spells.json
msgid "Psychic Attack"
msgstr "心灵攻击"

#. Description of spell
#: spells.json
msgid ""
"A mental assault that briefly causes pain and disorientation within a 3-tile radius."
msgstr "精神冲击，在半径 3 格内短暂造成疼痛与迷失。"

