#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_armor_bundle.json
msgid "packed Berserker armor"
msgstr "打包的狂战士铠甲"

#: items/armor_berserk/berserk_armor_bundle.json
msgid "All six pieces of Berserker armor fastened together for carrying.  Disassemble this bundle to recover the helmet, chestplate, gloves, armguards, legguards and boots before wearing them.  Packing and unpacking do not cleanse the armor's curse."
msgstr "六件狂战士铠甲绑在一起，便于携带。穿戴前拆开套装，取出头盔、胸甲、手套、臂甲、腿甲和靴子。打包和拆包都不会解除铠甲的诅咒。"

#: effects/arm_cannon_recipe_eoc.json
msgid "You learn 'prosthetic arm cannon CBM' and 'arm cannon charge'. Craft the cannon, then activate the item from your inventory to attach it."
msgstr "你学会了“机械臂炮CBM”和“臂炮火药弹”的配方。制作臂炮后，在物品栏中激活它即可安装。"

#: items/behelit.json
msgid "Behelit"
msgstr "贝赫莱特"

#: items/behelit.json
msgid "A small, unsettling stone with features that never seem to stay in place.  For now, activating it opens a test passage into the Eclipse; activate it there or examine the return seal to come back.  The full Eclipse encounter is not yet implemented."
msgstr "一块令人不安的小石头，表面的五官似乎不断变化。目前激活它可以进入日蚀测试区域；在里面再次激活，或查看返回印记，即可回到原处。完整的日蚀事件尚未实现。"

#: items/behelit.json
msgid "Activate Behelit"
msgstr "激活贝赫莱特"

#: overmap/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Eclipse (test area)"
msgstr "日蚀（测试区域）"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Eclipse return seal"
msgstr "日蚀返回印记"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "An inert mark on the floor.  Examine it to return to the place where you activated the Behelit."
msgstr "地面上的一道静止印记。查看它即可返回激活贝赫莱特的地方。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "Enter the Eclipse test area?  Only your carried equipment will follow you.  Activate the Behelit or examine the return seal to leave."
msgstr "进入日蚀测试区域吗？只有随身携带的物品会与你一同传送。激活贝赫莱特或查看返回印记即可离开。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The Behelit draws you into a silent chamber of living flesh."
msgstr "贝赫莱特将你拉入一间由活体血肉构成的寂静房间。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The passage does not open.  You remain where you are."
msgstr "通道未能开启。你仍留在原地。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The Behelit cannot find a safe passage.  Nothing happens."
msgstr "贝赫莱特找不到安全的通道。什么都没有发生。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "No place of return is recorded for you."
msgstr "没有记录你的返回地点。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "Return to the place where you activated the Behelit?  Leave anything on the ground behind."
msgstr "返回激活贝赫莱特的地方吗？留在地上的物品不会随你返回。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The Eclipse recedes.  You return to the world you left."
msgstr "日蚀逐渐退去。你回到了来时的世界。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The return passage is blocked.  Try again from the seal."
msgstr "返回通道被堵住了。请从印记处重试。"

#: effects/eclipse_rescue_eocs.json
msgid "The Skull Knight's escape route is blocked. Use the Behelit to leave; the rescue will finish once you return."
msgstr "骷髅骑士的逃生通道被堵住了。请使用贝赫莱特离开；返回后救援便会完成。"

#: effects/eclipse_state_eocs.json
msgid "The Skull Knight tears you free of the Eclipse. Your left hand is gone, but you have survived. You know how to build a prosthetic arm cannon and its charge. A new era begins."
msgstr "骷髅骑士将你从日蚀中救出。你失去了左手，但活了下来。你现在知道如何制作义肢臂炮植入体及其弹药。一个新时代开始了。"

#: effects/eclipse_rescue_eocs.json
msgid "Your strength fails. As the Eclipse closes in, a blade cuts through the darkness. The Skull Knight appears between you and the abyss."
msgstr "你的力量耗尽了。蚀的黑暗步步逼近，一道剑光劈开黑暗。骷髅骑士挡在你与深渊之间。"

#: effects/eclipse_rescue_eocs.json
msgid "The Skull Knight opens a path through the Eclipse. 'Hold on. We leave now.'"
msgstr "骷髅骑士在蚀中劈开一条道路。“撑住。我们现在离开。”"

#: effects/eclipse_aftermath_eocs.json
msgid "The Skull Knight has brought you back. Your left hand and an eye are gone. The Brand of Sacrifice burns on your body. You can now craft the prosthetic arm cannon and its charge. Activate the crafted cannon from your inventory to attach it yourself."
msgstr "骷髅骑士把你带了回来。你的左手和一只眼睛没了。祭品烙印灼烧着你的身体。你现在可以制作义肢手炮及其弹药。在物品栏中激活制作好的臂炮，即可自行安装。"

#: monsters/skull_knight_rescuer.json
msgid "The Skull Knight who pulled you from the Eclipse. He will speak with you, but will not turn his sword on you or your allies."
msgstr "将你从蚀中救出的骷髅骑士。他愿意与你交谈，也不会对你或你的盟友挥剑。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'The Eclipse has not claimed you yet. I will cut a way out. Stay close.' Beyond his shoulder, the darkness recoils from his blade."
msgstr "“蚀还没有夺走你。我会劈开一条路。跟紧我。”在他的身后，黑暗被剑刃逼退。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "What is happening?"
msgstr "发生了什么？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Get me out of here."
msgstr "带我离开这里。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Survive first. Answers can wait.' He raises his sword, and a path opens through the dark."
msgstr "“先活下去。答案可以等等。”他举起剑，黑暗中裂开一条道路。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Follow the Skull Knight."
msgstr "跟随骷髅骑士。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'You escaped, but the Eclipse has marked you. Your hand is gone. What comes next is yours to decide.'"
msgstr "“你逃出来了，但蚀在你身上留下了印记。你的手已经没了。接下来怎么走，由你自己决定。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "How can I replace my hand?"
msgstr "我该怎么替换我的手？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "I need to go."
msgstr "我该走了。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Craft the prosthetic arm cannon and its charge. Once the cannon is made, activate it from your inventory. The mount where your left hand used to be will hold it.'"
msgstr "“制作机械臂炮和弹药。完成后，在物品栏中激活臂炮。失去左手后留下的接口会将它固定住。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "I understand."
msgstr "我明白了。"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "Eclipse wretch"
msgstr "蚀之孽物"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "A gaunt shape of torn skin and exposed teeth, the first creature to crawl out after the Eclipse. It rushes its prey in a pack, relying on numbers rather than strength."
msgstr "瘦骨嶙峋的怪物，皮肤撕裂，獠牙外露，是蚀之刻后最早爬出的邪物之一。它们成群扑向猎物，靠数量而非力量取胜。"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "Eclipse half-demon"
msgstr "蚀之半魔"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "Human proportions remain beneath swollen flesh and a crooked jaw. This half-demon lunges across the last few steps before its victim can retreat."
msgstr "肿胀的血肉和歪斜的下颚下仍依稀可见人形。这个半恶魔会猛扑过最后几步，不给猎物后退的机会。"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "Eclipse hunter"
msgstr "蚀之猎手"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "Too thin for its height, with long limbs and sharpened nails. It moves faster than its kin and darts at anyone who leaves a gap in their guard."
msgstr "身形高瘦得不成比例，四肢修长，指甲锋利。它比同类更快，专扑防守露出破绽的猎物。"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "Eclipse butcher"
msgstr "蚀之屠夫"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "A hulking mass of knotted muscle drags its heavy arms through the ruins. It is slow and easy to evade, but a direct blow can break through light armor."
msgstr "一座肌肉虬结的肉山拖着沉重的双臂穿过废墟。它动作迟缓，容易躲开，但正面一击足以击穿轻甲。"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "Eclipse executioner"
msgstr "蚀之刽子手"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "An executioner from the depths of the Eclipse, armored in hardened flesh. It raises its blade before a devastating cleave; that brief warning is the last chance to step away."
msgstr "来自蚀之刻深处的刽子手，身披硬化血肉。它会先举起刀刃，再发动毁灭性的劈砍；那短暂的预兆是最后的躲避机会。"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "The executioner brings its blade down on you!"
msgstr "刽子手的刀刃向你劈下！"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "The executioner brings its blade down on %s!"
msgstr "刽子手的刀刃向%s劈下！"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "You slip away from the executioner's heavy strike!"
msgstr "你躲开了刽子手的重击！"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "%s slips away from the executioner's heavy strike!"
msgstr "%s躲开了刽子手的重击！"

#: monsters/eclipse_demons.json
msgid "The executioner raises its blade for a crushing strike!"
msgstr "刽子手举起刀刃，准备发动毁灭性的一击！"

#: effects/eclipse_combat_effects.json
msgid "Preparing a cleave"
msgstr "蓄势劈砍"

#: effects/eclipse_combat_effects.json
msgid "This creature is winding up for a heavy blow."
msgstr "这个生物正准备发动重击。"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Judeau's body"
msgstr "捷度的遗体"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Judeau lies motionless among the remains of the Band of the Hawk. His throwing knives are still close by."
msgstr "捷度一动不动地躺在鹰之团的遗骸之间。他的飞刀还散落在身旁。"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Pippin's body"
msgstr "比宾的遗体"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Pippin fell holding the passage. His great hammer lies within reach."
msgstr "比宾在守住通道时倒下。他的重锤就落在触手可及的地方。"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Corkus's body"
msgstr "哥尔卡斯的遗体"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Corkus did not escape the Eclipse. A slender blade lies beside him."
msgstr "哥尔卡斯没能逃出蚀。一柄细长的剑躺在他身旁。"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Gaston's body"
msgstr "加斯顿的遗体"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Gaston lies beneath a worn steel breastplate, far from the others."
msgstr "加斯顿身穿磨损的钢制胸甲，倒在远离其他人的地方。"

#: monsters/griffith_eclipse.json
msgid "Griffith of the Eclipse"
msgstr "蚀之格里菲斯"

#: monsters/griffith_eclipse.json
msgid "Griffith waits at the heart of the Eclipse. His familiar silhouette is surrounded by the remains of a world that should not exist."
msgstr "格里菲斯在蚀的中心等待着。熟悉的身影周围，是一个本不该存在的世界的残骸。"

#: effects/eclipse_victory_eocs.json
msgid "Griffith falls. The Eclipse shudders, but does not release you. The Skull Knight cuts a path through the closing darkness."
msgstr "格里菲斯倒下了。蚀为之震颤，却依然没有放过你。骷髅骑士在合拢的黑暗中劈开一条道路。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'You brought him down. Even so, this place will devour what remains of you. Come with me, now.'"
msgstr "“你打倒了他。但这地方仍会吞噬你剩下的一切。现在跟我走。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Follow the Skull Knight out of the Eclipse."
msgstr "跟随骷髅骑士离开蚀。"

#: items/behelit.json
msgid "A small, unsettling stone with features that never seem to stay in place. Activating it opens a passage into the Eclipse. Activate it there or examine the return seal to come back."
msgstr "一块令人不安的小石头，五官似乎不停变化。激活它会打开通往蚀的道路。要返回，那里再次激活它或查看返回印记。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "Enter the Eclipse? Only your carried equipment will follow you. Activate the Behelit or examine the return seal to leave."
msgstr "要进入蚀吗？只有随身携带的装备会与你一同前往。激活贝赫莱特或查看返回印记即可离开。"

#: overmap/eclipse_dungeon.json
msgid "Eclipse"
msgstr "蚀"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The Behelit has gone quiet. The Eclipse has ended for you."
msgstr "贝赫莱特沉寂了。对你而言，蚀已结束。"

#: bionics/eclipse_marks.json
msgid "Brand of Sacrifice"
msgstr "祭品烙印"

#: bionics/eclipse_marks.json
msgid "The mark left by the Eclipse. After dark it draws real demons toward you. It aches when demons gather and warns of a powerful presence nearby, without revealing its identity or direction."
msgstr "蚀之刻留下的烙印。入夜后，它会将真正的恶魔引向你。恶魔聚集时会隐隐作痛，也会对附近的强大存在发出警示，但不会指出其身份或方向。"

#: bionics/eclipse_marks.json
msgid "The Brand of Sacrifice is seared into your body."
msgstr "祭品烙印已烙入你的身体。"

#: bionics/eclipse_marks.json
msgid "Lost eye"
msgstr "失去一只眼睛"

#: bionics/eclipse_marks.json
msgid "An eye was lost during the Eclipse. Your Perception is halved."
msgstr "你在蚀之刻失去了一只眼睛。感知减半。"

#: bionics/eclipse_marks.json
msgid "Removing a record of the wound would not restore the lost eye."
msgstr "抹去伤痕记录也无法让失去的眼睛复原。"

#: effects/eclipse_brand_eocs.json
msgid "The Brand of Sacrifice stings. Demons are gathering nearby."
msgstr "祭品烙印阵阵刺痛。恶魔正在附近聚集。"

#: effects/eclipse_brand_eocs.json
msgid "The Brand of Sacrifice burns. A terrifying presence is somewhere nearby."
msgstr "祭品烙印灼痛难忍。附近有一股可怖的气息。"

#: effects/brand_cooldowns.json
msgid "Brand of Sacrifice: warning fading"
msgstr "祭品烙印：警兆渐息"

#: effects/brand_cooldowns.json
msgid "The brand has recently warned you of nearby demons."
msgstr "烙印刚刚警示过附近的恶魔。"

#: effects/brand_cooldowns.json
msgid "Brand of Sacrifice: ominous warning fading"
msgstr "祭品烙印：凶兆渐息"

#: effects/brand_cooldowns.json
msgid "The brand has recently sensed a powerful nearby presence."
msgstr "烙印刚刚感知到附近的强大存在。"

#: items/bionics/arm_cannon_cbms.json
msgid "Attach arm cannon"
msgstr "装上机械臂炮"

#: effects/arm_cannon_install_eocs.json
msgid "You attach the arm cannon to your missing left hand. Activate the new bionic to deploy it."
msgstr "你把机械臂炮装在失去的左手处。激活新的义体即可展开臂炮。"

#: effects/arm_cannon_install_eocs.json
msgid "The cannon has nowhere to attach. Your left hand must be missing."
msgstr "臂炮没有可以固定的接口。你必须先失去左手。"

#: effects/arm_cannon_install_eocs.json
msgid "You already have an arm cannon installed."
msgstr "你已经装有机械臂炮。"

#: effects/arm_cannon_install_eocs.json
msgid "Keep the crafted arm cannon in your inventory to attach it."
msgstr "将制作好的机械臂炮放在物品栏中，才能安装。"

#: monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "Projection of Zodd"
msgid_plural "Projections of Zodd"
msgstr[0] "佐德的投影"

#: monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "Reflection of Griffith"
msgid_plural "Reflections of Griffith"
msgstr[0] "格里菲斯的映像"

#: monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "Reflection of Void"
msgid_plural "Reflections of Void"
msgstr[0] "沃伊德的映像"

#: monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "A scarred silhouette shaped like Nosferatu Zodd. Its blows are real, but the creature itself is only a fragment drawn into this world around a Behelit."
msgstr "一道形似诺斯费拉图·佐德、满身伤痕的轮廓。它的攻击确实会伤人，但它本身只是围绕贝黑莱特降临此世的一道碎影。"

#: monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "A winged reflection of Griffith, drawn into the world around a Behelit. Destroying this apparition does not kill the being whose image it bears."
msgstr "格里菲斯的有翼映像，因贝黑莱特而降临此世。摧毁这道幻影，并不会杀死它所映照的本尊。"

#: monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "Void's likeness looms from a breach in reality. This dangerous reflection gathered around a Behelit, but its destruction cannot reach the original."
msgstr "沃伊德的形貌从现实的裂隙中浮现。这道危险的映像因贝黑莱特而凝聚，毁掉它也无法伤及本尊。"

#: monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The %s unravels, leaving a Behelit behind."
msgstr "%s逐渐消散，留下了一枚贝黑莱特。"

#: effects_on_condition.json
msgid "A reflection of Griffith appears in a flare of dark power!"
msgstr "一阵黑暗力量闪过，格里菲斯的映像出现了！"

#: overmap/behelit_sites.json
msgid "cursed oak"
msgstr "проклятый дуб"

#: overmap/behelit_sites.json
msgid "echo cave"
msgstr "回声洞窟"

#: overmap/behelit_sites.json
msgid "echo cave depth"
msgstr "回声洞窟深处"

#: monsters/behelit_site_guardians.json
msgid "cursed oak demon"
msgid_plural "cursed oak demons"
msgstr[0] "诅咒橡树恶魔"

#: monsters/behelit_site_guardians.json
msgid "echo cave demon"
msgid_plural "echo cave demons"
msgstr[0] "回声洞窟恶魔"

#: monsters/behelit_site_guardians.json
msgid "An oak that learned to wear a predator's face. Its split bark hides teeth and a burning eye; roots tear free of the soil when it reaches for the living. It guards the Behelit among its roots."
msgstr "一棵学会披上掠食者面孔的橡树。裂开的树皮里藏着利齿和燃烧的眼睛；当它伸向活人时，树根会破土而出。它守护着根间的贝黑莱特。"

#: monsters/behelit_site_guardians.json
msgid "A hunched mass of bone and torn flesh that listens to footsteps in the dark. Its many joints let it lunge around stone pillars. A Behelit rests deeper inside its lair."
msgstr "一团佝偻的骨骸与裂肉，在黑暗中倾听脚步。它关节众多，能够绕过石柱猛扑。贝黑莱特藏在巢穴更深处。"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "Behelit among the roots"
msgstr "树根间的贝黑莱特"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "A stone face is knotted into the old oak's roots. Examine it when the guardian cannot reach you."
msgstr "石头面孔缠在老橡树的根间。等守卫无法触及你时，再仔细查看。"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "empty oak roots"
msgstr "空荡的橡树根"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "The Behelit is gone. The old roots now hold only stones and dried blood."
msgstr "贝黑莱特已经不见了。老树根间只剩石块与干涸的血迹。"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "Behelit in the stone hollow"
msgstr "石穴中的贝黑莱特"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "A Behelit lies in a hollow at the center of the cave. Examine it when its keeper is away."
msgstr "贝黑莱特 леж在洞窟中央的石穴中。等守卫离开时再仔细查看。"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "empty stone hollow"
msgstr "空荡的石穴"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "The hollow has already yielded its Behelit."
msgstr "石穴中的贝黑莱特已经被取走了。"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The oak demon catches you with a lashing root!"
msgstr "橡树恶魔的树根抽中了你！"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The oak demon catches %s with a lashing root!"
msgstr "橡树恶魔的树根抽中了%s！"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The oak demon's root lashes past you!"
msgstr "橡树恶魔的树根从你身边抽过！"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The oak demon's root lashes past %s!"
msgstr "橡树恶魔的树根从%s身边抽过！"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The cave demon lunges and tears at you!"
msgstr "洞窟恶魔扑向你，撕扯你的血肉！"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The cave demon lunges and tears at %s!"
msgstr "洞窟恶魔扑向%s，撕扯血肉！"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The cave demon lunges past you!"
msgstr "洞窟恶魔从你身边扑过！"

#: monster_special_attacks/behelit_site_attacks.json
msgid "The cave demon lunges past %s!"
msgstr "洞窟恶魔从%s身边扑过！"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "You wrench the Behelit from the roots. The oak's grasp cannot reach you here."
msgstr "你从树根间夺走贝黑莱特。橡树的爪根此刻够不到你。"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "The oak demon's roots tighten around the Behelit. Drive it away or lure it from the hollow."
msgstr "橡树恶魔的树根缠紧了贝黑莱特。击败它，或把它引离树穴。"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "You take the Behelit from the stone hollow while its keeper is gone."
msgstr "趁守卫不在，你从石穴中取走贝黑莱特。"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "The cave demon hears your movement near the hollow. Draw it away or kill it first."
msgstr "洞窟恶魔听见你在石穴旁的动静。引开它，或先杀死它。"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "hanging bone chimes"
msgstr "悬挂的骨铃"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "A cord of bones hangs at the edge of the clearing. Examine it to make a distracting noise, then circle back toward the roots."
msgstr "空地边缘挂着一串骨头。拨动它制造响声，再绕回树根旁。"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "loose stone chime"
msgstr "松石响铃"

#: furniture/behelit_sites.json
msgid "Loose stones have been strung over a hollow at the back of the cave. Examine them to make a loud echo and draw the keeper away from its relic."
msgstr "洞窟深处的空穴上方吊着几块松石。拨动它们制造巨响，引开看守遗物的恶魔。"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "The bone chimes clatter through the trees!"
msgstr "骨铃的响声传遍树林！"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "The bone chimes rattle. Now is your chance to draw the oak demon away."
msgstr "骨铃响了。趁现在把橡树恶魔引开。"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "Stones crash and echo through the cave!"
msgstr "石块撞击的巨响在洞窟中回荡！"

#: effects/behelit_site_eocs.json
msgid "The stone chime rings through the cave. Use the pillars to circle behind the keeper."
msgstr "石铃在洞窟中响起。利用石柱绕到守卫身后。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "Enter the Eclipse? Only your carried equipment will follow you. The Behelit will be consumed when the passage opens, and there is no path back until the final confrontation."
msgstr "进入蚀之刻？只有随身携带的装备会跟随你。通道开启时贝黑莱特会被消耗；在最终对决前无法返回。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The Behelit draws you onto a field of living flesh. Behind you, the passage seals shut."
msgstr "贝黑莱特将你拉进一片活生生的血肉之原。身后的通道随即封闭。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "The passage behind you is gone. Only the final confrontation remains."
msgstr "身后的通道消失了。只剩下最终对决。"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "Return to the place where you activated the Behelit? Leave anything on the ground behind."
msgstr "返回你启动贝黑莱特的地点？留在地上的物品都会被遗弃。"

#: effects/eclipse_rescue_eocs.json
msgid "The Skull Knight's escape route is blocked. Reach the rift in the final field and try the passage again."
msgstr "骷髅骑士开辟的逃生道路被堵住了。前往终场的裂隙再试一次。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "Judeau fought to keep a path open for the others. Only his knives and a small hilt remain in the blood-soaked earth."
msgstr "捷度奋力为其他人守住退路。浸血的土地上只剩下他的飞刀和一截小小的刀柄。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "Pippin stood his ground when the line collapsed. The clasp from his armor is still caught beneath his hand."
msgstr "防线崩溃时，彼宾仍坚守原地。他的手下还压着一枚盔甲搭扣。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "Corkus ran toward a gap in the swarm. The path closed before he reached it."
msgstr "哥尔卡斯冲向魔群中的缺口，但还没赶到，退路就被堵死了。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "Gaston faced the center of the ceremony. Whatever he saw there stopped him in his tracks."
msgstr "加斯顿面朝仪式中心。他在那里看见的东西让他僵在原地。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "Someone abandoned a satchel of bandages and painkillers. A hunter circles nearby; taking them may cost more than a detour."
msgstr "有人丢下了一袋绷带和止痛药。猎手正在附近徘徊；取走补给也许比绕路更危险。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "These tracks split around the pits. One route winds wide and quiet; the shorter route leads past the hunter."
msgstr "脚印在坑洞旁分开。一条路迂回而安静；近路要经过猎手身边。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "The creatures are occupied with the dead. You can cross the open flank or challenge the cluster head-on."
msgstr "怪物正忙着啃食死者。你可以从开阔侧翼绕过，或正面挑战它们。"

#: effects/eclipse_field_scenes.json
msgid "The field grows still. Ahead lies Griffith and the end of the procession. Your way back vanished when the Behelit opened."
msgstr "旷野忽然安静。前方是格里菲斯，也是这场行进的终点。贝黑莱特开启时，你的退路就已消失。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "A mark left by an older passage. Examine it to return only if you entered before the passage began consuming Behelits."
msgstr "旧通道留下的印记。只有在通道开始消耗贝黑莱特之前进入的人，才能借此返回。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "sealed Eclipse passage"
msgstr "封闭的蚀之刻通道"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "The Behelit has dissolved into this scar of flesh. There is no passage back."
msgstr "贝黑莱特已融入这道血肉伤痕。这里没有回头路。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Skull Knight's escape rift"
msgstr "骷髅骑士的逃生裂隙"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "A cut through the ceremony's darkness. After the Skull Knight intervenes, examine it if the return passage is blocked."
msgstr "仪式黑暗中的一道裂口。骷髅骑士出手后，若归途受阻，就检查这处裂隙。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Judeau's remains"
msgstr "捷度的遗骸"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "A quiet hand rests beside three spent knife sheaths. Examine the body to remember how he covered the retreat."
msgstr "一只静止的手旁躺着三只空刀鞘。检查遗体，回想他如何掩护众人撤退。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Pippin's remains"
msgstr "彼宾的遗骸"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "His body still lies between the fallen and the oncoming horror. Examine what he defended."
msgstr "他的身体仍横在死者与逼近的恐怖之间。看看他守护的地方。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Corkus's remains"
msgstr "哥尔卡斯的遗骸"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "A broken stance and a useless blade tell the end of his flight. Examine the scene."
msgstr "扭曲的姿势与无用的刀刃诉说着他逃亡的结局。检查现场。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Gaston's remains"
msgstr "加斯顿的遗骸"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "His battered breastplate is turned toward the final ceremony. Examine the body."
msgstr "他破损的胸甲朝向最后的仪式。检查遗体。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "broken field satchel"
msgstr "破损的野战挎包"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "A torn satchel holds a few medical supplies. Something hunts near this exposed patch of ground."
msgstr "破损的挎包里还剩些医疗用品。某个东西正在这片暴露的空地附近狩猎。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "trampled escape trail"
msgstr "被践踏的逃生小径"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Tracks scatter around the pits and converge again beyond them. Examine the trail."
msgstr "足迹绕开坑洞，又在另一头汇合。检查这条小径。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "remains of a feast"
msgstr "盛宴的残迹"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "The demons have gathered around the fallen. Examine the site, or skirt the revelers."
msgstr "恶魔聚在死者身旁。检查现场，或绕过这群饕餮之徒。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "ceremonial scars"
msgstr "仪式伤痕"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "Deep cuts in the living ground point toward the final gathering. Examine the scars."
msgstr "活着的大地上深深的割痕指向最后的集会。检查伤痕。"

#: furniture/eclipse_trial.json
msgid "living ground"
msgstr "活着的土地"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "A vast expanse of yielding, scarred flesh stretches beneath the Eclipse."
msgstr "蚀之刻下方，大片柔软而伤痕累累的血肉延伸到视野尽头。"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "ash-covered ground"
msgstr "覆灰的地面"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "Ash clings to the living ground where the sacrificial crowd once stood. It is firm enough to cross."
msgstr "灰烬覆盖着祭品曾经聚集的活地面。这里仍能通行。"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "trampled flesh"
msgstr "踩踏过的血肉"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "A network of shallow scars marks the paths taken by fleeing survivors."
msgstr "浅浅的伤痕标记着幸存者逃离时走过的路线。"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "dim vein"
msgstr "微光血脉"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "A faint pulse of light travels beneath the ground. It barely illuminates the way ahead."
msgstr "微弱的光在地面下脉动，勉强照亮前方的路。"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "flesh ridge"
msgstr "血肉隆脊"

#: mapgen/eclipse_palettes.json
msgid "Folded flesh rises into a solid ridge, hiding the field beyond it."
msgstr "层叠的血肉隆起成坚实的脊，遮住了另一侧的战场。"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Judeau's knife hilt"
msgstr "捷度的刀柄"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "A worn knife hilt from the Band of the Hawk. Carry it when you speak to the Skull Knight about the Eclipse."
msgstr "鹰之团成员用过的磨损刀柄。若想向骷髅骑士询问蚀之刻，就随身带着它。"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "Pippin's broken clasp"
msgstr "彼宾断裂的搭扣"

#: items/eclipse_fallen_band.json
msgid "The last clasp from Pippin's battered armor. Carry it when you ask the Skull Knight about those left behind."
msgstr "彼宾残破盔甲上最后的一枚搭扣。若要向骷髅骑士询问那些被留下的人，就带着它。"

#: items/behelit.json
msgid "A small, unsettling stone with features that never seem to stay in place. A successful activation opens the Eclipse and consumes one Behelit. The way back closes; surviving the final confrontation is the only escape."
msgstr "一枚令人不安的小石头，面容仿佛不断变化。成功启动会开启蚀之刻并消耗一枚贝黑莱特。归途随之封闭；唯有在最终对决中活下来才能逃脱。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "I found Judeau's knife hilt. What happened to the Band?"
msgstr "我找到了捷度的刀柄。鹰之团究竟怎么了？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Pippin held the line. Could anyone else have escaped?"
msgstr "彼宾守住了防线。还有其他人逃出来吗？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'He bought a few breaths for those who followed him. Do not let this place turn that choice into nothing.' The Skull Knight glances at the ruined hilt."
msgstr "“他为身后的人争取了片刻喘息。别让这个地方使他的选择化为乌有。”骷髅骑士望向破损的刀柄。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "I will remember."
msgstr "我会记住。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'He stood where others would have fled. I cannot undo his death, but you can carry the memory of it beyond this field.'"
msgstr "“别人会逃离的地方，他却坚守不退。我无法改变他的死，但你可以把对他的记忆带出这片旷野。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "What should I do right now?"
msgstr "我现在该做什么？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "What happened, and why did you save me?"
msgstr "发生了什么？你为什么救我？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "What is the Brand, and why are nights dangerous?"
msgstr "烙印是什么？为什么夜晚如此危险？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "How do apostles differ from the God Hand?"
msgstr "使徒和神之手有什么区别？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Why did the creature I fought before the Eclipse return?"
msgstr "为什么我在蚀之前战斗过的怪物又出现了？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "What happened to my hand and eye?"
msgstr "我的手和眼睛怎么了？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Where do I go after I recover?"
msgstr "等我恢复之后该去哪里？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "I have my answers. Farewell, Skull Knight."
msgstr "我已经得到答案了。再会，骷髅骑士。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Ask something else."
msgstr "再问点别的。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Get clear of danger and tend your wounds. Rest in shelter; the Brand draws creatures after dark. The Berserker armor is no refuge while you recover. The recipes for the arm cannon and its charge are yours now.'"
msgstr "“离开险境，处理伤口。在掩体里休息；天黑后烙印会引来怪物。恢复期间，狂战士铠甲不是避难所。现在你已经掌握义肢炮和弹药的配方。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'The Behelit opened the Eclipse, a place of sacrifice. I could not undo what happened there. I cut a path out while there was still someone left to save.'"
msgstr "“贝黑莱特开启了蚀，献祭之地。我无法抹去那里发生的一切。趁还有人可以救，我杀出了一条路。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'The Brand marks a survivor of the sacrifice. Its pain warns you when demons draw near; a stronger presence hurts more. At night, expect them to seek you out. Find cover and leave yourself a way to flee.'"
msgstr "“烙印标记着献祭的幸存者。疼痛会警告你恶魔正在靠近；越强大的存在，痛得越厉害。夜里它们会追寻你。找好掩护，也给自己留一条退路。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Apostles are monstrous beings with wills and bodies of their own. The God Hand stand apart: they preside over the sacrifice. Void and Griffith are not ordinary apostles. Do not mistake surviving an encounter for defeating them.'"
msgstr "“使徒是拥有自身意志和肉体的怪物。神之手与他们不同：他们主持献祭。波伊德和格里菲斯不是普通使徒。别把从遭遇中幸存误认为击败了他们。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Some things you met before were projections: an echo formed around a Behelit. Breaking the echo leaves the true being untouched. The Behelit itself was real.'"
msgstr "“你先前遇到的一些存在只是投影：围绕贝黑莱特形成的回响。击碎回响不会伤及本体。贝黑莱特本身却是真的。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'You lost your left hand and an eye in the Eclipse. The missing hand limits your grip; the lost eye narrows your perception. The Brand is another wound, and it will keep calling to the dark.'"
msgstr "“你在蚀中失去了左手和一只眼睛。失去手会削弱抓握，失去眼会削弱感知。烙印是另一道伤口，它会不断呼唤黑暗。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Survive the coming nights. Gather what you need to make the arm cannon; then decide which traces of the apostles to follow. There is no safe road laid out for you.'"
msgstr "“先活过接下来的几个夜晚。收集制作义肢炮的材料，然后决定追寻哪位使徒的踪迹。前方没有安全的路。”"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: arrival"
msgstr "蚀之刻：降临之地"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: fallen band"
msgstr "蚀之刻：战死的鹰之团"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: abandoned supplies"
msgstr "蚀之刻：遗弃的补给"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: torn field"
msgstr "蚀之刻：撕裂的战场"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: crossroads"
msgstr "蚀之刻：岔路"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: feast"
msgstr "蚀之刻：血肉盛宴"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: hunting ground"
msgstr "蚀之刻：狩猎场"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: scarred ravine"
msgstr "蚀之刻：伤痕峡谷"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: final approach"
msgstr "蚀之刻：最终通路"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: last stand"
msgstr "蚀之刻：最后的抵抗"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: ceremony threshold"
msgstr "蚀之刻：仪式门槛"

#: overmap/eclipse_expanded.json
msgid "Eclipse: ceremony"
msgstr "蚀之刻：仪式"

#: effects/eclipse_trial_eocs.json
msgid "An ashen trail leads east to the fallen band, then bends south toward the ceremony. Narrower tracks branch into the dark."
msgstr "覆灰的小径向东通往牺牲的鹰之团，随后向南弯向仪式。更窄的足迹延伸进黑暗。"

#: furniture/shelter_ward.json
msgid "bone and stone ward"
msgstr "骨石护符"

#: furniture/shelter_ward.json
msgid "A ring of bone and stone marked against the Brand of Sacrifice. It weakens the Brand's summons within eight tiles, but does nothing to demons already nearby or those roaming the world."
msgstr "以骨石围成的护符，刻有抵御祭品烙印的符记。八格以内可抑制烙印的召唤，但无法驱逐已在附近或游荡于世间的恶魔。"

#: overmap/first_hunt.json
msgid "apostle's hollow"
msgstr "使徒巢穴"

#: monsters/first_hunt_apostle.json
msgid "apostle of the hollow"
msgid_plural "apostles of the hollow"
msgstr[0] "巢穴使徒"

#: monsters/first_hunt_apostle.json
msgid "A lesser apostle rooted in a forest hollow. Its hooked arms drag prey into the bare earth. It strikes in short lunges but cannot recover from sustained wounds."
msgstr "盘踞在森林巢穴中的下位使徒。钩状双臂将猎物拖向裸露的土地。它能短距离突袭，却无法从持续的伤势中恢复。"

#: items/first_hunt_clue.json
msgid "apostle's burned scrap"
msgstr "使徒的焦纸"

#: items/first_hunt_clue.json
msgid "A charred scrap covered with routes between old breaches. The hollow's keeper carried it. Its markings suggest this was only one of several places where the worlds touch."
msgstr "一张画着古老裂隙间路线的焦纸，由巢穴的守护者携带。标记表明此处只是数个世界交汇之地中的一个。"

#: effects/first_hunt_eocs.json
msgid "The Brand burns as you remember the Skull Knight's warning. A forest hollow is marked on your map. An apostle waits there; build a ward and prepare before following its trail."
msgstr "烙印灼痛，令你想起骷髅骑士的警告。地图上标出了森林巢穴。使徒正等在那里；追踪之前，先建造护符并做好准备。"

#: effects/first_hunt_eocs.json
msgid "The apostle falls. Its burned scrap holds traces of other breaches; this hunt is over, but the path beyond it remains."
msgstr "使徒倒下了。它的焦纸上还留着其他裂隙的线索。这场狩猎结束了，前路仍在延伸。"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'Tend your wounds and find a defensible shelter before nightfall. Build a bone and stone ward there: within eight tiles it quiets the Brand's summons, but wandering demons can still enter. The arm cannon and its charge can be crafted when you are ready.'"
msgstr "“处理伤口，在天黑前找到能守住的庇护所。在那里建造骨石护符：八格以内可以压制烙印的召唤，但游荡的恶魔仍可闯入。准备好之后再制作臂炮和弹药。”"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "'A lesser apostle has taken root in a forest hollow. Its location will be marked on your map. Build a ward, prepare your arm cannon if you can, and choose when to hunt it. Its remains may point toward the next breach.'"
msgstr "“一名下位使徒盘踞在森林巢穴。它的位置将标在你的地图上。先建造护符，如果可以，再备好臂炮，然后自行决定何时狩猎。它的遗物或许能指向下一个裂隙。”"

#: construction/shelter_ward.json
msgid "Build bone and stone ward"
msgstr "建造骨石护符"

#: items/first_hunt_clue.json
msgid "A charred scrap covered with routes between old breaches. The hollow's keeper carried it. Activate it after the first hunt to trace one nearby breach on your map."
msgstr "一张画着古老裂隙间路线的焦纸，由巢穴的守护者携带。完成首次狩猎后使用它，可在地图上找到附近的一处裂隙。"

#: items/first_hunt_clue.json
msgid "Follow the scorched trail"
msgstr "追寻焦灼的踪迹"

#: effects/first_hunt_eocs.json
msgid "The apostle falls. Search its remains for a burned scrap; activate the scrap to trace a nearby breach."
msgstr "使徒倒下了。搜索它的遗骸，找到焦纸并使用它，追查附近的裂隙。"

#: overmap/local_breach.json
msgid "ashen breach"
msgstr "灰烬裂隙"

#: furniture/local_breach.json
msgid "open breach"
msgstr "敞开的裂隙"

#: furniture/local_breach.json
msgid "The ground folds inward around a pulsing wound in the world. Defeat its guardian, then examine this place to close the breach."
msgstr "土地围绕着世界的伤口向内塌陷。击败守护者，然后调查此处以封闭裂隙。"

#: furniture/local_breach.json
msgid "sealed breach"
msgstr "封闭的裂隙"

#: furniture/local_breach.json
msgid "The wound in the world has hardened to black glass. New demonic incursions are weaker nearby; creatures already in the region remain."
msgstr "世界的伤口凝成黑色玻璃。附近新的恶魔侵袭减弱了，已经游荡在此的怪物仍然存在。"

#: monsters/breach_warden.json
msgid "breach warden"
msgid_plural "breach wardens"
msgstr[0] "裂隙守卫"

#: monsters/breach_warden.json
msgid "A heavy apostle bound to the wound in the forest. It guards the opening with deliberate blows. Beneath its armor of fused bone, nothing knits back together once broken."
msgstr "一名与森林伤口相连的沉重使徒。它以沉稳的重击守护裂隙。融合骨甲之下，破碎之处不会再生。"

#: items/post_eclipse_journal.json
msgid "journal of the first breach"
msgstr "第一处裂隙日志"

#: items/post_eclipse_journal.json
msgid "The burned scrap and the sealed wound explain two possible paths: defend a refuge and its people, or hunt the next apostle. Activate the journal to record your present intention. No further quest is unlocked yet."
msgstr "焦纸和封闭的伤口揭示了两条道路：守护庇护所和其中的人，或追猎下一名使徒。使用日志记录当前的决定。后续任务尚未开放。"

#: items/post_eclipse_journal.json
msgid "Consider the next path"
msgstr "思考下一步"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "The ashen breach is already marked on your map."
msgstr "灰烬裂隙已经标在地图上。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "The scorched routes make sense only after you survive the Eclipse and the first hunt. Read them above ground."
msgstr "只有经历日蚀与首次狩猎之后，焦灼的路线才有意义。请在地表查看。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "You follow the burned lines to an ashen breach marked on your map. Its guardian holds the opening; defeating it may let you close the wound."
msgstr "你循着焦纸上的线索，在地图上标出一处灰烬裂隙。守护者维持着裂口；击败它或许就能封闭伤口。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "You cannot locate the breach from here. Travel farther and consult the scrap again."
msgstr "无法从这里找到裂隙。请走得更远，再查看焦纸。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "The guardian collapses. The breach is exposed; examine its center to seal it."
msgstr "守护者倒下了。裂隙暴露出来；调查中心即可将其封闭。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "The wound turns to dark glass. New incursions weaken around this breach, but the demons already loose remain. A journal records what you have learned; choose your next path when ready."
msgstr "伤口化作暗色玻璃。附近新的侵袭减弱了，但已经出现的恶魔仍然游荡。日志记下了所知的一切；准备好后再选择下一条道路。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "The breach cannot be closed while its guardian lives. Defeat it and return to the center."
msgstr "守护者还活着，裂隙就无法关闭。击败它后返回中心。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "Record a promise to defend a refuge and its people?"
msgstr "记录守护庇护所和人们的誓言？"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "You choose to protect a refuge and those who reach it. The journal keeps this intention for a future chapter."
msgstr "你选择守护庇护所和到达那里的人们。日志会为未来的篇章保存这个决定。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "Record a vow to pursue the next apostle instead?"
msgstr "记录追猎下一名使徒的誓言？"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "You choose to follow the next apostle's trail. The journal keeps this intention for a future chapter."
msgstr "你选择追寻下一名使徒的踪迹。日志会为未来的篇章保存这个决定。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "You close the journal without changing your path."
msgstr "你合上日志，没有改变所选的道路。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "The journal has no ending to record until the local breach is sealed."
msgstr "当地裂隙尚未封闭，日志暂时没有结局可记录。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "You recover a Behelit from the hiding place. The empty recess holds nothing else."
msgstr "你从藏处取出贝黑莱特。空荡的凹槽中再无其他东西。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The guardian is too close to the hiding place. Defeat it or lure it away before taking the Behelit."
msgstr "守卫离藏处太近了。先击败它或将它引开，再取走贝黑莱特。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The hiding place has fallen silent. Your passage into the Eclipse has already been used; no Behelit remains here."
msgstr "藏处已经沉寂。你已使用过通往蚀之刻的道路；这里不再有贝黑莱特。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "You cannot open the hiding place. Nothing has been taken; you can try again."
msgstr "你无法打开藏处。你尚未取走任何东西，可以再试一次。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The %s unravels."
msgstr "%s消散了。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The cracked bell tolls across the ruined chapel!"
msgstr "开裂的钟声响彻破败的礼拜堂！"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The bell can draw the chapel's guardian south. The broken west wall offers another route to the reliquary."
msgstr "钟声可以将礼拜堂的守卫引向南方。西墙的缺口提供了另一条通往圣物匣的道路。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "An emergency siren howls through the abandoned camp!"
msgstr "紧急警报声响彻废弃的营地！"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The siren draws attention to the edge of camp. Circle around the ruined shelters to reach the specimen case."
msgstr "警报将注意力引向营地边缘。绕过破败的营舍，就能接近样本箱。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "desecrated chapel"
msgstr "被亵渎的礼拜堂"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "desecrated chapel reliquary"
msgstr "被亵渎的礼拜堂圣物室"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "lost expedition camp"
msgstr "失踪探险队营地"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "sealed chapel reliquary"
msgstr "封闭的礼拜堂圣物匣"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "A red stone face rests inside a cracked reliquary. The butcher guards the approach. Examine the case after defeating or distracting it."
msgstr "一张红色石面孔躺在开裂的圣物匣中。屠夫守着通路。击败或引开它后再检查匣子。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "silent chapel reliquary"
msgstr "沉寂的礼拜堂圣物匣"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The broken reliquary holds only dust. It will yield no Behelit."
msgstr "破损的圣物匣中只剩尘土，不会再出现贝黑莱特。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "cracked chapel bell"
msgstr "开裂的礼拜堂钟"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The fallen bell still hangs from a timber frame. Examine it to draw attention away from the northern reliquary."
msgstr "旧钟仍挂在木架上。检查它，将注意力从北面的圣物室引开。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "chapel inscription"
msgstr "礼拜堂碑文"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "Scratched words cover a stone near the entrance. Examine them to learn what lies farther north."
msgstr "入口附近的石头上刻着文字。检查它，了解北面藏着什么。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "sealed expedition specimen case"
msgstr "封闭的探险队样本箱"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "A stone with a human face rests inside a battered specimen case. A half-demon prowls nearby. Examine the case when it cannot reach you."
msgstr "一块长着人脸的石头躺在破旧的样本箱里。半恶魔在附近徘徊。等它无法接近你时再检查箱子。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "empty expedition specimen case"
msgstr "空的探险队样本箱"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The specimen case holds nothing but torn packing material. It will yield no Behelit."
msgstr "样本箱中只剩破碎的包装材料，不会再出现贝黑莱特。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "wind-up emergency siren"
msgstr "手摇紧急警报器"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "A hand-cranked siren lies at the southern edge of camp. Examine it to distract the creature guarding the specimen shelter."
msgstr "一台手摇警报器放在营地南缘。检查它，引开守着样本营舍的生物。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "expedition field log"
msgstr "探险队野外日志"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "Water-stained pages remain pinned to the camp table. Examine them for the expedition's final observations."
msgstr "营地桌上钉着被水浸过的纸页。检查它们，阅读探险队最后的观察记录。"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The inscription reads: \"We hid the red stone in the northern reliquary. The thing that followed it cannot resist the bell. Circle through the broken west wall while it searches the nave.\""
msgstr "碑文写道：“我们把红石藏在北面的圣物室。追着它来的东西会被钟声吸引。趁它在主厅搜索时，从西墙缺口绕过去。”"

#: effects/behelit_reward_eocs.json effects/behelit_site_eocs.json furniture/behelit_sites.json overmap/behelit_sites.json monsters/apostle_projections.json
msgid "The final entry reads: \"Specimen: a red stone face, secured in the northeastern shelter. A human-shaped predator keeps returning to it. Use the hand-cranked siren to draw it south, then approach through the gaps between the shelters.\""
msgstr "最后一条记录写道：“样本：红色石面孔，存放于东北方营舍。一个人形捕食者不断返回那里。用手摇警报器将它引向南方，再从营舍之间的空隙接近。”"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count's breach hardens into cold stone. New incursions weaken within roughly two overmap tiles of this place. The Brand and the demons already here remain."
msgstr "伯爵的裂口凝成冰冷的石头。此地约两格大地图范围内的新入侵减弱。烙印和已经出现的恶魔仍然存在。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count's residence is marked on your map. His servants patrol the grounds; the apostle waits below the execution hall."
msgstr "伯爵的宅邸已标在地图上。他的仆从巡视庭院；使徒在行刑大厅下方等待。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "Follow this trail above ground after surviving the Eclipse and completing the first hunt."
msgstr "在幸存于蚀并完成第一次狩猎后，到地面上追寻这条线索。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "A trail of executions leads to the Count's fortified residence, now marked on your map. Explore the grounds before descending. His servants are mortal; no endless reinforcements will replace them."
msgstr "行刑的线索通向伯爵的设防宅邸，现已标在地图上。下去之前先侦察庭院。他的仆从会死，不会有无穷无尽的援军。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "No suitable residence could be located nearby. Travel elsewhere and consult the hunt journal or the Skull Knight again."
msgstr "附近未能找到合适的宅邸。去别处，再查阅狩猎日记或询问骷髅骑士。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count is dead. His broken iron seal remains among his spoils. Examine the exposed breach at the north end of the dungeon to close this local wound."
msgstr "伯爵已死。他的战利品中留下破碎的铁印。检查地牢北端暴露的裂口，封闭这道局部伤口。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The breach is still held by the Count. Defeat him before examining it again."
msgstr "伯爵仍控制着裂口。击败他后再来检查。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The opening resisted the seal. Step away from its center and examine it again; the hunt has not been marked complete."
msgstr "裂口未能封闭。离开其中心再检查一次；狩猎尚未标记为完成。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The stone records an execution list. A different hand scratched beneath it: \"The thing below us made his servants from men. Clear the yard; there are passages through both wings. The stairs lie in the northeastern hall. Leave room to evade his heavy body.\""
msgstr "石上刻着处决名单。下方另一只手划写道：“下面的怪物把人变成仆从。清理庭院；两翼都有通路。楼梯在东北大厅。留出空间躲避他沉重的身体。”"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count's shattered iron seal is proof of your hunt. Closing his exposed breach quiets future incursions near his residence, but does not erase the Brand. Other apostles must be hunted separately. This trophy grants no damage or Berserk-duration bonus."
msgstr "伯爵破碎的铁印是狩猎的凭证。封闭其裂口可减弱宅邸附近的未来入侵，但不会抹去烙印。其他使徒必须分别狩猎。此战利品不提供伤害或狂战士持续时间加成。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "You choose to pursue the next apostle. The journal now traces the Count's residence; you can return to this trail even if the Skull Knight has departed."
msgstr "你决定追寻下一个使徒。日记现在指向伯爵的宅邸；即使骷髅骑士已离开，你仍能再次追寻此线索。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The first sealed breach opened two possible paths. Activate this journal to consider protecting a refuge or to trace the Count's residence. His hunt has its own record and local breach."
msgstr "第一个封闭的裂口开启两条道路。使用此日记，考虑守护庇护所或追踪伯爵的宅邸。这次狩猎及其局部裂口有独立记录。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "Preparing a body sweep"
msgstr "准备横扫"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count is drawing back his massive body for a sweeping blow. Move out of reach."
msgstr "伯爵收回巨大的身体，准备横扫。离开他的攻击范围。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count coils his enormous body for a crushing sweep!"
msgstr "伯爵蜷起庞大的身体，准备粉碎性的横扫！"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count smashes his massive body into you!"
msgstr "伯爵巨大的身体撞上了你！"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count smashes his massive body into %s!"
msgstr "伯爵巨大的身体撞上了%s！"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count's heavy body sweeps past you!"
msgstr "伯爵沉重的身体从你身旁扫过！"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count's heavy body sweeps past %s!"
msgstr "伯爵沉重的身体从%s身旁扫过！"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "Counts"
msgstr "伯爵"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count, an apostle whose swollen, slug-like body fills the dungeon. He ruled through executions and twisted servants. His weight makes every close blow dangerous, but he turns slowly and his wounds do not regenerate. When he coils his body, leave room to evade the sweep."
msgstr "伯爵，使徒肿胀的蛞蝓般身躯占据地牢。他以处决和扭曲的仆从统治。沉重的身体让每次近身打击都很危险，但他行动迟缓，伤口不会再生。他蜷起身体时，要留出躲避横扫的空间。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's twisted servants"
msgstr "伯爵的扭曲仆从"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "A human servant remade with the Count's flesh. A second jaw splits its chest, but beneath the deformity its body is still vulnerable. This servant will not be replaced when killed."
msgstr "被伯爵的血肉改造的人类仆从。第二张嘴裂开胸膛，但畸形之下的身体依然脆弱。它死后不会有新的仆从补位。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "survivor of the Count's prison"
msgstr "伯爵监牢的幸存者"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "An unnamed prisoner hiding in the abandoned western wing. They know the passage to the execution hall and will speak if you approach. This encounter is an adaptation, not a named character from the manga."
msgstr "一名无名囚徒躲在废弃的西翼。他知道通往行刑大厅的通道，靠近后可以交谈。这场遭遇是改编内容，并非漫画中的具名角色。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's shattered iron seal"
msgstr "伯爵破碎的铁印"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "A heavy seal torn from the Count's remains. Keep it as proof of the hunt. Activate it to recall how to close his local breach. It is a trophy, not a universal crystal upgrade."
msgstr "从伯爵遗骸中取出的沉重铁印。保留它作为狩猎凭证。使用可回顾如何封闭他的局部裂口。这是战利品，并非万能升级水晶。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "Recall the Count's breach"
msgstr "回顾伯爵的裂口"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "\"Keep your voice down. I hid here when the Count remade the others. I can show you where he waits, but I will not go back down there.\""
msgstr "“小声些。伯爵改造其他人时，我躲到了这里。我能告诉你他在哪，但不会再下去。”"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "How do I reach him?"
msgstr "怎么找到他？"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "What are his servants?"
msgstr "他的仆从是什么？"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "He is dead. What about the opening below?"
msgstr "他死了。下面的裂口怎么办？"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "Stay here. I will look around."
msgstr "留在这里。我去看看。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "\"The execution hall is in the northeast. The stairs go down from its center. Both wings lead there; the broken western wall gives you another way around the yard. The pillars below will break his line of sight, but do not let his body pin you against them.\""
msgstr "“行刑大厅在东北，楼梯在大厅中央。两翼都通向那里；西墙缺口能绕过庭院。下面的柱子能挡住视线，但别让他把你压在柱子上。”"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "\"They were people. He forced his own flesh into them. There are only a few left here. Kill them separately if you must; they will not return, and he cannot call an endless army.\""
msgstr "“他们曾经是人。他强行把自己的血肉塞进他们体内。这里只有几个了。必要时逐个消灭；他们不会回来，他也召不出无穷大军。”"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "\"The exposed stone at the north end feeds this place. Examine it now that he cannot hold it open. It should quiet new incursions nearby. It will not undo your Brand or kill the things already outside.\""
msgstr "“北端暴露的石头为这里提供力量。现在他无法维持裂口，去检查它。附近的新入侵应该会减弱。但它不会消除烙印，也不会杀死已经出来的东西。”"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "I survived the first hunt. Show me the Count's trail."
msgstr "我活过了第一次狩猎。告诉我伯爵的线索。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "\"The Count is no projection. His fortified residence shelters men he remade with his flesh. Explore the wings, clear the servants, then descend beneath the northeastern execution hall. His death exposes one local wound; each apostle and each breach must be answered separately.\""
msgstr "“伯爵不是投影。他的设防宅邸里藏着被他血肉改造的人。探索两翼，清除仆从，再下到东北行刑大厅下方。他死后会暴露一道局部伤口；每个使徒、每道裂口都必须分别解决。”"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's exposed breach"
msgstr "伯爵暴露的裂口"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "A raw seam in the northern stone. Examine it after killing the Count to weaken future incursions around this residence."
msgstr "北侧石中的鲜红裂缝。杀死伯爵后检查它，可减弱宅邸周围的未来入侵。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's execution record"
msgstr "伯爵的处决记录"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "Names and a scratched warning. Examine the record before descending into the dungeon."
msgstr "姓名和刻下的警告。下地牢前检查记录。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's sealed breach"
msgstr "伯爵封闭的裂口"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The Count's wound has closed. Its nearby influence is recorded in the world; existing demons remain."
msgstr "伯爵的伤口已闭合。附近影响的减弱已记录在世界中；已经出现的恶魔仍在。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's western prison"
msgstr "伯爵的西侧监牢"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's execution hall"
msgstr "伯爵的行刑大厅"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's west courtyard"
msgstr "伯爵的西庭院"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's east courtyard"
msgstr "伯爵的东庭院"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "the Count's dungeon"
msgstr "伯爵的地牢"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "echo cave gallery"
msgstr "回响洞穴长廊"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "echo cave winding passage"
msgstr "回响洞穴曲折通道"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "echo cave relic chamber"
msgstr "回响洞穴遗物室"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "A stone chime hangs beside the winding western passage. Stand next to it and examine it to make a loud echo. Break the keeper's line of sight first: noise cannot force it to ignore visible prey."
msgstr "石钟挂在曲折的西侧通道旁。站在旁边检查它，制造响亮回声。先避开守卫的视线：噪声不能迫使它忽视看得见的猎物。"

#. New Horizon: independent Count hunt and expanded echo cave
msgid "The stone chime rings out. Use the winding galleries to break line of sight and approach the eastern relic chamber by the other route."
msgstr "石钟响起。利用曲折的长廊避开视线，从另一条路线靠近东侧遗物室。"


#. New Horizon monster plural
msgid "the Count"
msgid_plural "Counts"
msgstr[0] "伯爵"


#. New Horizon monster plural
msgid "the Count's twisted servant"
msgid_plural "the Count's twisted servants"
msgstr[0] "伯爵的扭曲仆从"

#: items/apostle_relics.json
msgid "Seal of Severed Flesh"
msgid_plural "Seals of Severed Flesh"
msgstr[0] "裂肉之印"

#: items/apostle_relics.json
msgid "Beast Knot"
msgid_plural "Beast Knots"
msgstr[0] "野兽之结"

#: items/apostle_relics.json
msgid "Mistvale Veil"
msgid_plural "Mistvale Veils"
msgstr[0] "雾谷之纱"

#: items/apostle_relics.json
msgid "Flaming Carapace Shard"
msgid_plural "Flaming Carapace Shards"
msgstr[0] "烈焰甲壳碎片"

#: items/apostle_relics.json
msgid "A broken iron seal wrested from the Count. Wear it to deal an additional 20% of each damaging hit to the mod's listed demons, apostles and their projections, rounded down after their defenses. It gives no bonus against ordinary zombies or people. Carrying it is not enough. Activate it to recall how to close the Count's breach."
msgstr "从伯爵遗骸中夺得的破碎铁印。佩戴后，对模组指定列表中的恶魔、使徒及其投影，每次造成伤害的命中额外造成20%伤害，在敌方防御结算后向下取整。对普通丧尸和人类无效。仅放在物品栏中不会生效。激活可回顾关闭伯爵裂隙的方法。"

#: items/apostle_relics.json
msgid "A sinewy knot in which a beast's frenzy still stirs. Wear it before Berserk mode begins to extend that activation from 150 to 210 seconds. Removing or putting it on during a rage does not change the running timer. The blood loss, exhaustion and three-day recovery remain unchanged. Carrying it is not enough."
msgstr "一枚仍涌动着兽性狂怒的筋腱结。狂战士模式开始前佩戴，可将本次持续时间从150秒延长至210秒。狂怒期间佩戴或摘下它不会改变当前计时。失血、力竭和三天的恢复期保持不变。仅放在物品栏中不会生效。"

#: items/apostle_relics.json
msgid "A pale veil threaded with the lingering mist of Rosine's valley. While worn, it grants +1 to your dodge bonus. It does not make every attack miss and currently grants no stamina benefit. Carrying it is not enough."
msgstr "一袭织入罗西娜山谷残雾的苍白薄纱。佩戴时闪避加值增加1，但不保证躲过所有攻击，目前也不提供耐力加成。仅放在物品栏中不会生效。"

#: items/apostle_relics.json
msgid "A dark shard of Grunbeld's fiery carapace. While worn, it reduces incoming heat damage by 20% before clothing protection and provides modest cooling in hot conditions. It does not protect against smoke, prevent your equipment from burning or make you fireproof. Carrying it is not enough."
msgstr "古伦贝鲁多烈焰甲壳的暗色碎片。佩戴时，在衣物防护结算前将受到的热伤害减少20%，并略微缓解高温。它不防烟雾，不保护装备免于燃烧，也不会让你免疫火焰。仅放在物品栏中不会生效。"

#: effects/berserk_mode_eocs.json
msgid "The armor takes control! Berserk mode: <u_val:berserk_mode_duration> seconds. When it ends, your stamina will empty and you will lose a great deal of blood. Prepare an escape now!"
msgstr "铠甲夺取了控制！狂战士模式：<u_val:berserk_mode_duration>秒。结束后，你的耐力将耗尽，并会大量失血。现在就准备好退路！"

#: effects/berserk_mode_eocs.json
msgid "Berserk mode: 150 seconds remaining."
msgstr "狂战士模式：剩余150秒。"

#: effects/berserk_mode_eocs.json
msgid "Berserk mode: 180 seconds remaining."
msgstr "狂战士模式：剩余180秒。"

#: effects/apostle_hunt_eocs.json
msgid "Wear the Seal of Severed Flesh to add 20% of each damaging hit against the listed demons, apostles and projections; the extra damage is rounded down after their defenses. Zombies and people receive no extra damage. Closing the Count's exposed breach quiets future incursions near his residence, but does not erase the Brand. Other apostles must be hunted separately."
msgstr "佩戴裂肉之印后，对指定列表中的恶魔、使徒及投影，每次造成伤害的命中额外造成20%伤害，按防御结算后的数值向下取整。丧尸和人类不受额外伤害。关闭伯爵暴露的裂隙可减弱其宅邸附近的后续入侵，但不会消除烙印。其他使徒仍须分别猎杀。"

#: effects/flora_eocs.json
msgid "Flora's manor is marked on your map. She can explain the Brand and the armor even if you already own a complete set."
msgstr "芙罗拉的宅邸已标在地图上。即使你已有完整铠甲，她仍能解释烙印与铠甲。"

#: effects/flora_eocs.json
msgid "Recover after the Eclipse and complete the first hunt, then ask the Skull Knight about Flora above ground."
msgstr "从蚀中恢复并完成第一次狩猎后，在地表向骷髅骑士询问芙罗拉。"

#: effects/flora_eocs.json
msgid "A sheltered forest manor is marked on your map. Flora waits in the western study. Follow the garden paths; the house has western and southern exits."
msgstr "地图上标出了一座隐蔽的林间宅邸。芙罗拉在西侧书房等候。沿花园小径前行；房屋有西门和南门。"

#: effects/flora_eocs.json
msgid "No suitable forest clearing was found nearby. Travel to another area and consult the Skull Knight or his directions again. No armor has been claimed."
msgstr "附近没有合适的林间空地。换个地区，再向骷髅骑士询问或查看他的指引。尚未领取铠甲。"

#: effects/flora_eocs.json
msgid "Flora gives you the missing pieces of Berserker armor. Existing pieces are kept. The gift is offered once; check your inventory and the floor if you cannot carry it all. Nothing forces you to wear it."
msgstr "芙罗拉将缺少的狂战士铠甲部件交给你，已有部件会保留。此赠礼只能领取一次；若带不下，请查看物品栏和地面。你不必立刻穿上它。"

#: effects/flora_eocs.json
msgid "Flora cannot offer another set now. You must have survived the Eclipse, speak to her in person, and not already possess a complete or packed set or have accepted her gift."
msgstr "芙罗拉现在无法再赠送一套。你必须已从蚀中生还并当面与她交谈；持有完整或打包铠甲，或已领取赠礼，都会阻止重复领取。"

#: effects/flora_eocs.json
msgid "You begin after the Eclipse: the Brand, lost eye and prosthetic arm are already part of your body, and the new era has begun. The Eclipse cannot be entered again. Speak to the Skull Knight and prepare for your first hunt."
msgstr "你从蚀之后开始：烙印、失去的眼睛和义肢已是你身体的一部分，新时代也已开始。无法再次进入蚀。与骷髅骑士交谈，为第一次狩猎做准备。"

#: monsters/flora.json
msgid "Flora"
msgstr "芙罗拉"

#: monsters/flora.json
msgid "A wise witch tending a quiet sanctuary in the forest. She can explain the Brand and the cursed armor. This story actor remains where she is and will not attack you or your companions."
msgstr "守护林间宁静庇护所的睿智女巫。她能解释烙印与诅咒铠甲。这个剧情角色会留在原地，不会攻击你或你的同伴。"

#: furniture/flora.json
msgid "Flora's sanctuary ward"
msgstr "芙罗拉的庇护结界"

#: furniture/flora.json
msgid "A ring of pale stones and living roots anchors the quiet grove. While the manor remains peaceful, it suppresses new era encounters nearby and the Brand's night summons. It does not remove demons already present or the armor's shadows."
msgstr "浅色石块与活根构成圆环，维系着林地的宁静。宅邸和平时，会抑制附近新时代遭遇和烙印的夜间召唤，但不会清除已有恶魔或铠甲产生的暗影。"

#: overmap/flora_manor.json
msgid "Flora's western manor"
msgstr "芙罗拉宅邸西翼"

#: overmap/flora_manor.json
msgid "Flora's eastern manor"
msgstr "芙罗拉宅邸东翼"

#: overmap/flora_manor.json
msgid "Flora's west garden"
msgstr "芙罗拉的西花园"

#: overmap/flora_manor.json
msgid "Flora's east garden"
msgstr "芙罗拉的东花园"

#: items/flora_directions.json
msgid "the Skull Knight's directions to Flora"
msgstr "骷髅骑士留下的芙罗拉指引"

#: items/flora_directions.json
msgid "Remembered directions to a secluded forest manor. Activate them after the first hunt to locate Flora or reveal the same manor again. They are memories, not a book, and can be used without knowing how to read."
msgstr "通往隐蔽林间宅邸的记忆指引。第一次狩猎后激活，可寻找芙罗拉或再次标出同一座宅邸。这是记忆而非书本，不识字也能使用。"

#: items/flora_directions.json
msgid "Recall the way to Flora"
msgstr "回想通往芙罗拉的路"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "The first hunt is over. Where can I find Flora?"
msgstr "第一次狩猎结束了。我在哪里能找到芙罗拉？"

#: dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "\"Seek Flora in her forest manor. She understands the mark you bear and the armor that can carry you beyond ordinary limits. If you already possess the entire armor, ask for counsel rather than another gift. Remember these directions; you need not keep me here to follow them.\""
msgstr "“去林间宅邸寻找芙罗拉。她了解你的烙印，也了解能让你超越凡人极限的铠甲。若你已有全套铠甲，就寻求指点，而不是另一份赠礼。记住这些指引；不必把我留在身边也能找到她。”"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "What does the Brand mean, and why do things come at night?"
msgstr "烙印意味着什么？为何怪物会在夜里出现？"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "What is the Berserker armor?"
msgstr "狂战士铠甲是什么？"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "What price will I pay for Berserk mode?"
msgstr "狂战士模式要付出什么代价？"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "What are apostles, projections and the God Hand?"
msgstr "使徒、投影与神之手有何区别？"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "Can a trophy taken from an apostle help me?"
msgstr "从使徒身上取得的战利品能帮助我吗？"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "What should I do next?"
msgstr "我下一步该做什么？"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "I already have all six pieces, or the packed armor."
msgstr "我已有全部六件部件，或打包好的铠甲。"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "Will you entrust the armor to me?"
msgstr "你愿意把铠甲交给我吗？"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "You already helped me with the armor."
msgstr "你已经帮我取得铠甲了。"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "Has the armor already been given away?"
msgstr "铠甲已经赠给别人了吗？"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "I will return when I am ready."
msgstr "准备好后我会再来。"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "\"You have found a quiet place, traveler. Here you may ask before you choose. A suit of armor is not a cure for a wounded soul, and possessing it is not the end of your road.\""
msgstr "“旅人，你找到了一处宁静之地。在做出选择前，你可以先问清楚。铠甲并不能治愈受伤的灵魂，拥有它也不是旅途的终点。”"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "\"The Brand calls to beings beyond the ordinary world. Its pain can warn of a nearby presence, but it gives neither a name nor a direction. After dark, prepare cover and a way out. A bone and stone ward quiets its summons within eight tiles; it cannot banish creatures already there. This grove also offers a limited respite while it remains peaceful.\""
msgstr "“烙印会召唤超出常世的存在。它的疼痛能警告你附近有东西，却不会给出名称或方向。入夜后要准备掩体和退路。骨石结界可抑制八格范围内的召唤，却不能驱逐已经到来的怪物。这片林地和平时也能提供有限的喘息机会。”"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "\"The armor forces a wounded body onward and gives strength, but wearing it builds tension. Your senses falter, and shadows gather. It is not draining blood continuously anymore; the great loss comes when Berserk mode ends. You may wear ordinary clothing beneath the separate pieces. A packed suit must be unpacked before it can be worn.\""
msgstr "“铠甲驱使受伤的身体继续前进，并赋予力量，但穿着会积累紧张。感官会衰弱，暗影会聚集。现在它不会持续放血；大量失血发生在狂战士模式结束时。各部件下面可以穿普通衣物。打包铠甲必须先拆开才能穿。”"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "\"Without a Beast Knot, the rage lasts 150 seconds. A Knot worn before it begins extends it to 210; putting it on during the rage does not. When it ends, stamina is emptied, blood volume falls and a three-day recovery follows. Taking off the armor ends the rush, not its price. Heed the warning window and countdown. Prepare your retreat before losing control.\""
msgstr "“没有野兽之结时，狂怒持续150秒。开始前佩戴兽结可延长至210秒，狂怒中途佩戴则无效。结束后耐力耗尽、血容量下降，并进入三天恢复期。脱下铠甲能结束爆发，却不能免除代价。留意警告窗口和倒计时；失控之前就准备好退路。”"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "\"An apostle has a body and a will of its own. A projection is an echo: destroying it does not kill the original. The God Hand preside over sacrifice and are not ordinary prey. Judge the creature before you, not merely a familiar name. A residence, servants and traces of victims can tell you more than a rumor.\""
msgstr "“使徒有自己的身体与意志。投影只是回声，摧毁它不会杀死本体。神之手主持献祭，并非普通猎物。判断眼前的存在，而不只是熟悉的名字。宅邸、仆从与受害者的痕迹，比传闻更能说明问题。”"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "\"A trophy is not a universal crystal that washes every curse away. The Count's Seal of Severed Flesh adds damage against a specific list of demons only while worn. Other relics have their own limits. They can support a choice, but cannot replace preparation or undo the Brand.\""
msgstr "“战利品不是能洗净所有诅咒的万能水晶。伯爵的裂肉之印仅在佩戴时，对指定列表中的恶魔增加伤害。其他遗物也各有界限。它们能帮助你的选择，却无法代替准备，更不能消除烙印。”"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "Mark the Count's trail."
msgstr "标出伯爵的踪迹。"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "\"Keep a defensible refuge and learn to use the prosthetic arm cannon before seeking a greater enemy. After the first hunt, the Count's residence is a separate trail; the Skull Knight or your hunt journal can mark it. Explore both wings, defeat the servants, then descend beneath the northeastern hall. His death exposes a breach that must be closed separately. Do not rush from my door straight into his.\""
msgstr "“保住可防守的庇护所，学会使用义肢臂炮，再追寻更强的敌人。第一次狩猎后，另一条线索通往伯爵宅邸；骷髅骑士或狩猎日志可以标出它。探索两翼、击败仆从，再下到东北大厅之下。他死后暴露的裂隙仍须另行封闭。不要刚离开我的门，就冲进他的门。”"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "\"Then there is no need for a second suit. Whether you carry the packed armor or its six separate parts, keep what is yours. We may still speak of its dangers and your next journey. Owning the armor does not close my door to you.\""
msgstr "“那就不需要第二套铠甲了。无论是打包的，还是六件分开的部件，都保留属于你的东西。我们仍可讨论它的危险和接下来的旅程。拥有铠甲不会让我的门对你关闭。”"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "I understand. Entrust the missing armor to me."
msgstr "我明白。请把缺少的铠甲交给我。"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "Not yet. I want to ask more first."
msgstr "还没有。我想先问清楚。"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "\"I can entrust the missing parts to you once. A helmet or gauntlet found elsewhere does not disqualify you; I will not duplicate it. Accept only after you understand the tension, shadows and the blood price of the rage. You need not wear the armor immediately.\""
msgstr "“我能把缺少的部件交给你一次。别处找到的头盔或手套不会使你失去资格，只是不会重复赠送。理解紧张、暗影与狂怒的失血代价后再接受。你不必立刻穿上铠甲。”"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "\"Make your preparations deliberately. I will not take your existing armor or force you into the new pieces. If they are too heavy to carry, check the floor nearby. You may return with questions; this meeting does not send you into a battle without a choice.\""
msgstr "“认真做好准备。我不会拿走你已有的铠甲，也不会强迫你穿上新部件。若带不下，请查看附近地面。你可以回来继续提问；这次会面不会让你毫无选择地被送入战斗。”"

#: dialogue/flora.json
msgid "\"The armor I guarded has already been entrusted to a traveler. I cannot conjure endless copies. My counsel and these paths remain open to you.\""
msgstr "“我守护的铠甲已交给一位旅人。我不能凭空制造无尽的复制品，但我的建议与这些道路仍向你开放。”"

#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Berserker after the Eclipse"
msgstr "蚀后的狂战士"

#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Berserker after the Eclipse"
msgstr "蚀后的狂战士"

#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You begin after the Eclipse with the true sword and all six pieces of Berserker armor. Your left hand carries an installed prosthetic arm cannon; an eye is lost, and the Brand of Sacrifice calls to demons. The Eclipse is already behind you and the new era is active. Speak to the Skull Knight, establish a refuge and follow the first hunt."
msgstr "你从蚀之后开始，持有真正的大剑与全部六件狂战士铠甲。左手已装上义肢臂炮，一只眼睛失去，牺牲烙印会召来恶魔。蚀已经过去，新时代已开启。与骷髅骑士交谈，建立庇护所，再追寻第一次狩猎。"

#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You begin after the Eclipse with the true sword and all six pieces of Berserker armor. Your left hand carries an installed prosthetic arm cannon; an eye is lost, and the Brand of Sacrifice calls to demons. The Eclipse is already behind you and the new era is active. Speak to the Skull Knight, establish a refuge and follow the first hunt."
msgstr "你从蚀之后开始，持有真正的大剑与全部六件狂战士铠甲。左手已装上义肢臂炮，一只眼睛失去，牺牲烙印会召来恶魔。蚀已经过去，新时代已开启。与骷髅骑士交谈，建立庇护所，再追寻第一次狩猎。"

#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Berserker before the Eclipse"
msgstr "蚀前的狂战士"

#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Berserker before the Eclipse"
msgstr "蚀前的狂战士"

#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid "You begin before the Eclipse, with both hands and eyes intact, an early true sword, leather-padded armor and a light barbute helm. There is no Brand, cannon or cursed armor at this start. Find a Behelit and face the Eclipse before seeking Flora and the armor. Starting in a world where the Eclipse already happened does not reset that world."
msgstr "你从蚀之前开始，双手双眼完好，持有早期真正的大剑、皮革衬垫护具与轻型巴布特头盔。此开局没有烙印、臂炮或诅咒铠甲。找到贝黑莱特，经历蚀后再寻找芙罗拉与铠甲。在已经发生蚀的世界中开局，不会重置世界历史。"

#: professions/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid "You begin before the Eclipse, with both hands and eyes intact, an early true sword, leather-padded armor and a light barbute helm. There is no Brand, cannon or cursed armor at this start. Find a Behelit and face the Eclipse before seeking Flora and the armor. Starting in a world where the Eclipse already happened does not reset that world."
msgstr "你从蚀之前开始，双手双眼完好，持有早期真正的大剑、皮革衬垫护具与轻型巴布特头盔。此开局没有烙印、臂炮或诅咒铠甲。找到贝黑莱特，经历蚀后再寻找芙罗拉与铠甲。在已经发生蚀的世界中开局，不会重置世界历史。"

#: items/true_guts_early_sword.json
msgid "Guts' Early True Sword"
msgstr "格斯早期的真正大剑"

#: items/true_guts_early_sword.json
msgid "Guts' sword from before the Eclipse: a long, disciplined two-handed blade, not the Dragonslayer. It hits harder than an ordinary steel greatsword but lacks the overwhelming damage of his later true sword. This is the weapon of the before-Eclipse start."
msgstr "格斯在蚀之前使用的剑：修长而稳健的双手剑，还不是斩龙剑。它比普通钢制大剑更强，却没有后来真正大剑的压倒性伤害。这是蚀前开局的武器。"

#: scenarios/berserk_story_starts.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "(BERSERK) Before or after the Eclipse"
msgstr "(BERSERK) 蚀之前或之后"

#: scenarios/berserk_story_starts.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "(BERSERK) Before or after the Eclipse"
msgstr "(BERSERK) 蚀之前或之后"

#: scenarios/berserk_story_starts.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Choose the beginning of your road: before the sacrifice with ordinary leather armor, or after it with the Brand, prosthetic arm cannon and the cursed suit. The before-Eclipse profession does not rewind a world whose new era has already begun."
msgstr "选择旅程的起点：献祭前，穿普通皮革护具；或献祭后，带着烙印、义肢臂炮与诅咒铠甲。蚀前职业不会倒转已开启新时代的世界。"

#: scenarios/berserk_story_starts.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "Choose the beginning of your road: before the sacrifice with ordinary leather armor, or after it with the Brand, prosthetic arm cannon and the cursed suit. The before-Eclipse profession does not rewind a world whose new era has already begun."
msgstr "选择旅程的起点：献祭前，穿普通皮革护具；或献祭后，带着烙印、义肢臂炮与诅咒铠甲。蚀前职业不会倒转已开启新时代的世界。"

#: items/true_guts_early_sword.json
msgid "Guts' sword from before the Eclipse: a long blade shaped by years of battle, not the Dragonslayer. It hits harder than an ordinary steel greatsword but lacks the overwhelming damage of his later true sword. Like his later true sword, it has no forced two-handed restriction, so losing a hand does not make it unusable by definition."
msgstr "格斯在蚀之前使用的剑：经历多年战斗的修长剑刃，还不是斩龙剑。它比普通钢制大剑更强，却不及后来真正大剑的压倒性伤害。与后来的真正大剑一样，它没有强制双手限制，因此失去一只手本身不会使其必然无法使用。"

#: effects/local_breach_eocs.json
msgid "Follow the Skull Knight's remembered directions to Flora?"
msgstr "回想骷髅骑士的指引，寻找芙罗拉？"

#: items/post_eclipse_journal.json
msgid "The first sealed breach opened several paths. Activate this journal to follow the Skull Knight's remembered directions to Flora, consider protecting a refuge, or trace the Count's residence. His hunt has its own record and local breach."
msgstr "封闭第一个裂隙后，数条道路向你敞开。激活日志，可回想骷髅骑士通往芙罗拉的指引、考虑守护庇护所，或追踪伯爵宅邸。伯爵的狩猎与当地裂隙有独立记录。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "I am ready to accept the armor and face the attack."
msgstr "我准备好接受铠甲并面对袭击了。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "I understand the danger. Give me the armor and the escape charm."
msgstr "我明白其中的危险。请把铠甲和逃生护符交给我。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Not yet. I need to prepare and ask more."
msgstr "还不行。我需要准备，还有些问题要问。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "I need another escape charm before I begin."
msgstr "开始之前，我需要另一个逃生护符。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "\"There is no more time for counsel. The guardians are holding the northern and eastern approaches. Leave through the western road or the southern garden. Do not wait for a victory.\""
msgstr "“已经没有时间听取建议了。守卫正抵挡北面和东面的敌人。从西边的道路或南边的花园离开。不要等到获胜。”"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "\"If you take this road, the sanctuary will not remain your shelter. I will entrust the missing armor to you, and the guardians will buy time. Zodd approaches from the north; Grunbeld from the east. Do not try to defeat both. Prepare first, then activate my escape charm to begin. The western door and southern garden offer two ways out. Once you begin, there is no return to this peaceful house.\""
msgstr "“如果你选择这条路，这座庇护所就不会再是你的避难处。我会把缺少的铠甲部件交给你，守卫会争取时间。佐德从北面逼近，古伦贝尔德从东面而来。不要试图击败他们两人。先做好准备，再激活我的逃生护符。西门和南边的花园是两条出路。一旦开始，这座宁静的房屋就无法恢复原样了。”"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Flora's escape charm"
msgstr "芙罗拉的逃生护符"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Begin the escape from Flora's manor"
msgstr "开始逃离芙罗拉的宅邸"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Flora's token of your decision. Equip and pack the armor before activating it in her manor. Activation starts a one-time attack: guardians delay Zodd and Grunbeld, and you must leave by the western road or southern garden. It needs no power and does not teleport you. It cannot restart the siege."
msgstr "芙罗拉交给你的决意信物。在她的宅邸中激活前，先穿好铠甲并整理行装。激活会开始一次性袭击：守卫拖住佐德和古伦贝尔德，你必须从西边道路或南边花园离开。它不需要能源，也不会将你传送走。无法用它重新开始围攻。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Begin the one-time attack now? Prepare your armor first. The sanctuary will be lost; escape through the western road or southern garden."
msgstr "现在开始这次不可重来的袭击吗？请先准备好铠甲。庇护所将会失去；从西边道路或南边花园逃走。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Flora entrusts you with the armor and an escape charm. Equip and pack what you need first. Activate Flora's escape charm in the manor when ready: that starts the attack. Leave by the western door or the southern garden path; you need not kill the apostles. Until you activate it, the siege does not advance."
msgstr "芙罗拉把铠甲和逃生护符托付给你。先穿戴装备，打包所需物资。准备好后，在宅邸内激活芙罗拉的逃生护符，袭击才会开始。从西门或南边的花园小径离开；无需杀死使徒。在激活之前，围攻不会推进。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "wood cracking beyond the ward"
msgstr "结界外木头断裂的声音"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "The ward trembles. Root guardians rise outside the house as footsteps approach from the north and east. ESCAPE: use the western door or the southern door, then follow the ash-marked path beyond the grove. Zodd and Grunbeld arrive in about 30 seconds. Escape, not victory, is the objective."
msgstr "结界在颤抖。屋外的根须守卫升起，北面和东面传来脚步声。逃生：从西门或南门出去，沿着灰烬标记的小径离开树林。佐德和古伦贝尔德将在约30秒后到达。目标是逃脱，而不是获胜。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "The charm cannot begin another attack. Prepare with Flora after the Eclipse, then activate it in her still-peaceful manor."
msgstr "护符不能再开始一次袭击。在蚀之后与芙罗拉做好准备，再在她仍然宁静的宅邸内激活它。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "The northern ward breaks under a great blade; an armored giant closes from the east. The guardians can only delay them. Both escape paths remain open. Keep moving toward the western road or the southern garden exit."
msgstr "北面的结界被巨刃劈开；披甲的巨人从东面逼近。守卫只能拖延他们。两条逃生路线仍然畅通。继续向西边的道路或南边的花园出口前进。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "The upper rooms char and a section of the eastern wall gives way. The ward holds the embers back from the western and southern escape paths. Take what you need and leave the grove; staying to fight is your choice."
msgstr "北侧的房间开始焦黑，东墙的一部分倒塌了。结界阻挡余烬蔓延到西面和南面的逃生路线。带上所需物品，离开树林；留下战斗是你自己的选择。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "You reach the far side of the grove. Behind you, Flora's sanctuary becomes a silent, charred ruin. Its protection is gone. Apostles you killed remain dead; surviving attackers are not erased. Recover at your refuge, then follow the Count's trail when ready."
msgstr "你抵达了树林之外。身后，芙罗拉的庇护所变成了寂静焦黑的废墟，保护也消失了。被你杀死的使徒不会复活；仍然活着的袭击者不会被删除。在自己的避难处恢复，然后在准备好时循着伯爵的线索前进。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "An attacker could not enter the grove because its approach is blocked. Your escape remains available; the siege will not summon replacements endlessly."
msgstr "一名袭击者因入口被阻挡而无法进入树林。你仍然可以逃脱；围攻不会无休止地召唤替代敌人。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Flora's root guardian"
msgstr "芙罗拉的根须守卫"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Flora's root guardians"
msgstr "芙罗拉的根须守卫们"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "A knot of living roots raised by Flora outside her sanctuary. It holds its ground to delay the attackers, buying you time to escape. It will not attack you or your companions."
msgstr "芙罗拉在庇护所外唤起的一团活根。它坚守阵地，拖住袭击者，为你的逃跑争取时间。它不会攻击你或你的同伴。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Nosferatu Zodd, attacker of the grove"
msgstr "不死者佐德，树林的袭击者"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "The real Zodd has come to destroy Flora's sanctuary. Root guardians delay him at the northern ward. You are meant to escape, but if you kill him his death is recorded for future stories."
msgstr "真正的佐德来摧毁芙罗拉的庇护所。根须守卫在北面的结界拖住他。你应该逃跑，但如果杀死他，这次死亡会被记录在后续剧情中。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Grunbeld, attacker of the grove"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德，树林的袭击者"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "A towering armored apostle whose advance crushes the eastern ward. This encounter shows Grunbeld in his armored form, not his later dragon battle. Slow movement gives you a chance to escape. Killing him is optional and is recorded as the death of the original, not a projection."
msgstr "披甲的巨大使徒，推进时摧毁东面的结界。这次遭遇中的古伦贝尔德处于铠甲形态，而非后续战斗的巨龙形态。他行动缓慢，给你逃跑的机会。杀死他是可选的，这会被记录为本体死亡，而非投影消散。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "charred sanctuary floor"
msgstr "庇护所的焦黑地面"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Ash and scorched stone cover what remains of Flora's sanctuary. The grove no longer quiets the Brand."
msgstr "灰烬与焦石覆盖着芙罗拉庇护所的残骸。树林已无法让烙印安静下来。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "ward-bound embers"
msgstr "结界束缚的余烬"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Glowing embers held inside a ring of Flora's dying ward. They give light but cannot spread fire; the escape paths remain clear."
msgstr "发光的余烬被芙罗拉衰弱的结界环圈束缚。它们提供光亮，但不会蔓延火焰；逃生路线保持畅通。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Flora's broken ward"
msgstr "芙罗拉破碎的结界"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "The protective mark has burned cold. The Brand is no longer quieted here."
msgstr "保护印记已烧尽冷却。这里不再能安抚烙印。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "ash-marked escape path"
msgstr "灰烬标记的逃生小径"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Pale marks trace a clear path from the house toward the western road or southern garden."
msgstr "浅色标记指引一条从屋子通往西边道路或南边花园的畅通小径。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "charred sanctuary wall"
msgstr "庇护所的焦黑墙壁"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "The blackened shell of Flora's sanctuary. The walls no longer protect a peaceful haven."
msgstr "芙罗拉庇护所焦黑的外壳。墙壁已无法保护一个宁静的避难处。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Zodd has already fallen in this world. His old challenge will not resurrect him."
msgstr "佐德已在这个世界中死去。旧的挑战不会让他复活。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "Flora's burned manor is marked on your map. Its protection and peaceful meeting are gone. Recover at your refuge and follow your remaining hunts."
msgstr "芙罗拉烧毁的宅邸已标记在地图上。结界和宁静的会面都已消失。在自己的避难处恢复，然后继续尚未完成的狩猎。"

#: mods/Berserk/flora_siege
msgid "\"The grove has fallen. What Flora entrusted to you remains yours, but her house will no longer shelter the branded. Return to your refuge, recover, then follow the remaining trails. An original apostle killed there stays dead; a projection elsewhere is only an echo.\""
msgstr "“树林已经陷落。芙罗拉托付给你的东西仍然属于你，但她的房屋已无法再庇护被烙印者。回到你的避难处，恢复后再追寻剩余的线索。在那里杀死的使徒本体不会复活；别处的投影只不过是回响。”"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "\"Wyald holds a ruined encampment; Rosine rules a valley of cocoons. Your journal can mark either trail. Defeat each guardian, close that site's breach, then claim its relic. Neither victory abolishes the Brand. Choose which hunt to prepare for first.\""
msgstr "“瓦伊阿尔德占据着破败的营地；罗西妮统治着满是茧的山谷。日志可以标记任一条线索。击败守卫，封闭当地裂隙，再领取遗物。任何一场胜利都无法消除烙印。选择先准备哪一场狩猎。”"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "A closed wound containing one relic. Examine it to claim the reward once. Nearby existing demons remain."
msgstr "已封闭的伤口，内藏一件遗物。检查它可领取一次奖励。附近已有的恶魔不会消失。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "A living tear at the north of the final clearing. Defeat this site's apostle and examine it to seal only this local wound."
msgstr "最后一片空地北侧的活体裂隙。击败此地的使徒，再检查它，只封闭这一处伤口。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "A marauder remade by the Black Dogs' apostle. Its warped body still wears scraps of campaign gear. It guards the camp but is mortal and will not be replaced."
msgstr "被黑犬团使徒改造的掠夺者。扭曲的身躯仍披着残破的行军装备。它守卫营地，但可以被杀死，也不会被新的仆从取代。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "A split cocoon, empty now. It obscures the path without producing more creatures."
msgstr "裂开的空茧。它会妨碍通行，但不会产生更多生物。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "A winged apostle ruling a mist-veiled false paradise. Rosine fights quickly and folds her wings before a piercing dive. Break its straight line with trees or stone rather than trading blows. She does not regenerate and does not summon endless replacements."
msgstr "统治迷雾中虚假乐园的有翼使徒。罗西妮行动迅速，在刺穿目标的俯冲前收拢翅膀。用树木或岩石阻断直线，不要与她硬拼。她不会再生，也不会召唤无尽的增援。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "An insect-like creature from Rosine's cocoons, carrying the outline of a false fairy. Quick wings hide a fragile body. These creatures are placed in finite groups around the valley."
msgstr "来自罗西妮之茧的昆虫状生物，有着虚假妖精的轮廓。敏捷的翅膀掩盖了脆弱的身体。它们以数量有限的群体分布在山谷中。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Black Dog encampment — approach"
msgstr "黑犬团营地——入口"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Black Dog encampment — camp"
msgstr "黑犬团营地——营区"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Black Dog encampment — quarry"
msgstr "黑犬团营地——采石场"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Black Dog encampment — ring"
msgstr "黑犬团营地——斗场"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Mistvale — cocoons"
msgstr "迷雾山谷——茧群"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Mistvale — gully"
msgstr "迷雾山谷——沟壑"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Mistvale — nest"
msgstr "迷雾山谷——巢穴"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Mistvale — trail"
msgstr "迷雾山谷——小径"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Broken campaign orders name Wyald, leader of the Black Dogs. His heavy rush needs a clear line: step behind stone when he braces his body. A scratched note points toward Rosine's mist-filled valley. This camp is an adaptation of his pursuit, not a reconstruction of a manga panel."
msgstr "残破的行军命令提到了黑犬团首领瓦伊阿尔德。他的重击需要畅通的直线：当他绷紧身体时，躲到岩石后面。刻写的笔记指向罗西妮的迷雾山谷。此营地改编自他的追击，并非逐格复现漫画。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Consult the independent trails to Wyald and Rosine?"
msgstr "查阅通往瓦伊阿尔德和罗西妮的独立线索？"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Follow named apostle trails above ground after the Eclipse and the first hunt."
msgstr "在蚀和第一次狩猎之后，到地表追踪有名使徒的线索。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Hunt record: Count <global_val:berserk_hunt_count_state>, Wyald <global_val:berserk_hunt_wyald_state>, Rosine <global_val:berserk_hunt_rosine_state>. 0 or blank = unknown; 1 = found; 2 = encounter; 3 = guardian defeated; 4 = breach closed; 5 = relic received. Each place has its own coordinates."
msgstr "狩猎记录：伯爵 <global_val:berserk_hunt_count_state>，瓦伊阿尔德 <global_val:berserk_hunt_wyald_state>，罗西妮 <global_val:berserk_hunt_rosine_state>。0或空白=未知；1=已发现；2=遭遇开始；3=守卫被击败；4=裂隙已封闭；5=已领取遗物。每个地点有独立坐标。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Leader of the Black Dogs, swollen into a hulking apostle. He presses the attack and braces before a crushing long-reach blow. Stone cover breaks its line. His wounds do not regenerate. This is the original Wyald; defeating him exposes the camp's breach."
msgstr "黑犬团首领，膨胀成庞大的使徒。他不断施压，并在远距重击前绷紧身体。岩石掩体可以阻断攻击线。他的伤口不会再生。这是瓦伊阿尔德本体；击败他会暴露营地的裂隙。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Mark Rosine's trail."
msgstr "标记罗西妮的线索。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Mark Rosine's valley."
msgstr "标记罗西妮的山谷。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Mark Wyald's camp."
msgstr "标记瓦伊阿尔德的营地。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Mark Wyald's trail."
msgstr "标记瓦伊阿尔德的线索。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Preparing a crushing rush"
msgstr "正在准备重击"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Preparing a piercing dive"
msgstr "正在准备穿刺俯冲"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Recall an apostle trail"
msgstr "回忆使徒的线索"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Rosine"
msgstr "罗西妮"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Show me the trails to Wyald and Rosine."
msgstr "告诉我通往瓦伊阿尔德和罗西妮的路。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Trace Rosine's Mistvale?"
msgstr "追踪罗西妮的迷雾山谷？"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Trace Wyald and the Black Dogs?"
msgstr "追踪瓦伊阿尔德和黑犬团？"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Trace the Count's residence?"
msgstr "追踪伯爵的居所？"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Wyald"
msgstr "瓦伊阿尔德"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "empty Mistvale cocoon"
msgstr "迷雾山谷的空茧"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "journal of the named apostle hunts"
msgstr "有名使徒狩猎日志"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "No suitable forest site was found nearby. Travel to another region and consult the hunt journal again; no encounter or reward was consumed."
msgstr "附近未找到合适的森林地点。前往其他区域，再查阅狩猎日志；遭遇和奖励都没有被消耗。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Remembered trails to the Count, Wyald and Rosine. Activate to mark one known site or seek its unique lair after the first hunt. Each breach and relic has its own world record. These memories need no literacy; the journal works without the Skull Knight."
msgstr "记录通往伯爵、瓦伊阿尔德和罗西妮的记忆。激活可标记已知地点，或在第一次狩猎后寻找其唯一巢穴。每处裂隙与遗物都有独立的世界记录。无需识字；没有骷髅骑士也能使用日志。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Rosine braces for a heavy attack!"
msgstr "罗西妮正在准备重击！"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Rosine braces for a heavy attack! Break the line or leave its reach!"
msgstr "罗西妮正在准备重击！阻断攻击线，或离开其攻击范围！"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Rosine emerges in the final clearing. Read the preparation effect when a heavy attack is winding up; break the line or leave its reach. Retreat is still possible."
msgstr "罗西妮在最后的空地现身。注意重击准备的状态效果；阻断攻击线或离开攻击范围。仍然可以撤退。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Rosine is dead. The local breach is exposed in the northern part of the final clearing. Examine it to close the wound, then examine the sealed mark to claim the relic and recall the next trail."
msgstr "罗西妮已死。最后空地北侧的当地裂隙已经暴露。检查它以封闭伤口，再检查封印标记领取遗物并回忆下一条线索。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Rosine trail record"
msgstr "罗西妮的线索记录"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Rosine's exposed breach"
msgstr "罗西妮的暴露裂隙"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Rosine's prepared attack crashes into %s!"
msgstr "罗西妮蓄势的攻击击中了%s！"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Rosine's prepared attack crashes into you!"
msgstr "罗西妮蓄势的攻击击中了你！"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Rosine's prepared attack misses %s!"
msgstr "罗西妮蓄势的攻击未能击中%s！"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Rosine's prepared attack misses you!"
msgstr "罗西妮蓄势的攻击未能击中你！"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Rosine's sealed breach"
msgstr "罗西妮的封闭裂隙"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Wyald braces for a heavy attack!"
msgstr "瓦伊阿尔德正在准备重击！"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Wyald braces for a heavy attack! Break the line or leave its reach!"
msgstr "瓦伊阿尔德正在准备重击！阻断攻击线，或离开其攻击范围！"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Wyald emerges in the final clearing. Read the preparation effect when a heavy attack is winding up; break the line or leave its reach. Retreat is still possible."
msgstr "瓦伊阿尔德在最后的空地现身。注意重击准备的状态效果；阻断攻击线或离开攻击范围。仍然可以撤退。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Wyald is dead. The local breach is exposed in the northern part of the final clearing. Examine it to close the wound, then examine the sealed mark to claim the relic and recall the next trail."
msgstr "瓦伊阿尔德已死。最后空地北侧的当地裂隙已经暴露。检查它以封闭伤口，再检查封印标记领取遗物并回忆下一条线索。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Wyald trail record"
msgstr "瓦伊阿尔德的线索记录"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Wyald's exposed breach"
msgstr "瓦伊阿尔德的暴露裂隙"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Wyald's prepared attack crashes into %s!"
msgstr "瓦伊阿尔德蓄势的攻击击中了%s！"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Wyald's prepared attack crashes into you!"
msgstr "瓦伊阿尔德蓄势的攻击击中了你！"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Wyald's prepared attack misses %s!"
msgstr "瓦伊阿尔德蓄势的攻击未能击中%s！"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Wyald's prepared attack misses you!"
msgstr "瓦伊阿尔德蓄势的攻击未能击中你！"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Wyald's sealed breach"
msgstr "瓦伊阿尔德的封闭裂隙"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Rosine's Mistvale is marked on your map. Follow the pale trail east through the cocoons or loop south along the stony gully. The nest lies in the southeast; Rosine appears when you enter it."
msgstr "罗西妮的迷雾山谷已标记在地图上。沿浅色小径向东穿过茧群，或向南绕过石质沟壑。巢穴位于东南；进入后罗西妮才会出现。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Wyald's Black Dog encampment is marked on your map. Follow the broken cart tracks east or circle through the western quarry. The killing ring lies in the southeast; Wyald appears when you enter it."
msgstr "瓦伊阿尔德的黑犬团营地已标记在地图上。沿破损车辙向东，或绕过西侧采石场。斗场位于东南；进入后瓦伊阿尔德才会出现。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "The apostle's arrival is blocked. Clear the final clearing. After automatic retries end, examine the exposed breach to try again."
msgstr "使徒的到来被阻挡。清理最后的空地。自动重试结束后，检查暴露的裂隙可再次尝试。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "The available named hunts are settled. Consult the journal to revisit a known sealed site and recover near its quiet region. The later dragon hunt is not yet available."
msgstr "现有的有名使徒狩猎已完成。查阅日志以重访已知封闭地点，在平静区域附近恢复。后期的巨龙狩猎尚未开放。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "The available named hunts are settled. Your first sealed breach is marked again: recover near that quiet region and prepare your refuge. The journal keeps every cleared site; the later dragon hunt is not yet available."
msgstr "现有的有名使徒狩猎已完成。第一处封闭裂隙已重新标记：在其平静区域恢复并准备避难处。日志保存所有已清理地点；后期的巨龙狩猎尚未开放。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "The local breach is held by its guardian. Defeat the apostle first; if its approach was blocked, clear the final clearing and examine this mark to retry."
msgstr "守卫仍控制着裂隙。先击败使徒；若其出现被阻挡，请清理最后的空地并检查标记以重试。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "The seal did not take hold. Step away from its center and examine it again; no completion or reward was recorded."
msgstr "封印未能生效。离开中心位置后再次检查；未记录完成或奖励。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "These trails belong to the road after the Eclipse and the first hunt."
msgstr "这些线索属于蚀和第一次狩猎之后的旅途。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "This breach is sealed. New demonic incursions are suppressed only within roughly two overmap tiles of this place. Existing demons, the Brand and armor shadows remain. Examine the closed mark to claim the unique relic."
msgstr "裂隙已封闭。仅在此地周围约两格大地图范围内抑制新的恶魔侵入。已有恶魔、烙印和铠甲阴影仍然存在。检查封印标记以领取独特遗物。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "This closed mark has no second relic to give. Your recorded hunt remains complete."
msgstr "这个封印标记不会再给予第二件遗物。狩猎记录仍然是完成状态。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "This creature is preparing a heavy attack. Break its straight line or move beyond its reach."
msgstr "这个生物正在准备重击。阻断直线，或离开其攻击范围。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "Torn travelers' notes describe Rosine's false paradise: winged creatures, cocoons and victims who never came home. A dive needs a clear line; trunks and stone can break it. Other notes connect the trail to the Count's residence. Closing one valley will not undo the Brand."
msgstr "旅人的残破笔记描述了罗西妮的虚假乐园：有翼生物、茧，以及再未回家的受害者。俯冲需要畅通直线；树干和岩石可以阻断它。其他笔记将线索指向伯爵的居所。封闭一座山谷无法消除烙印。"

#: mods/Berserk/named_apostle_hunts
msgid "You claim the relic from the sealed mark. The gift is issued once for this hunt; check the floor if you cannot carry it. Wear it to receive its effect. The hunt journal preserves the directions."
msgstr "你从封印标记中取出了遗物。每场狩猎只会给予一次；若无法携带，请检查地面。穿戴遗物才能获得效果。狩猎日志会保存方向。"

#: mods/Berserk/monsters/apostle_wyald.json mods/Berserk/monsters/apostle_rosine.json
msgid "Black Dog thrall"
msgid_plural "Black Dog thralls"
msgstr[0] "黑犬团仆从"

#: mods/Berserk/monsters/apostle_wyald.json mods/Berserk/monsters/apostle_rosine.json
msgid "cocoon-born ravager"
msgid_plural "cocoon-born ravagers"
msgstr[0] "茧生掠食者"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld's scarred stronghold is marked on your map. Follow the pale stone track south; the western quarry and eastern ramparts join before the southeast crucible. His armored form appears only when you enter that final area. Prepare heat protection and leave room to retreat."
msgstr "古伦贝尔德残破的要塞已标记在地图上。沿浅色石路向南；西侧采石场与东侧堡垒在东南熔炉之前交汇。他的铠甲形态只会在进入最终区域后出现。准备抗热装备，并留出撤退空间。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld bars the crucible in his armored form. At half health his armor gives way to a dragon. Watch the visible preparations: leave the hammer reach, then use stone cover against the dragon's focused flame. Defeating the first form alone does not finish this hunt."
msgstr "古伦贝尔德以铠甲形态挡住熔炉。生命降至一半时，他将化为巨龙。注意可见的准备状态：离开战锤范围，再用岩石阻挡巨龙的集中烈焰。仅击败第一形态不会完成狩猎。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "A scorched campaign tablet names Grunbeld. The armored apostle is only the first form; the dragon's carapace resists blades and heat, but does not regenerate. Stone blocks the focused flame. Close the wound north of the crucible after his final defeat, then claim its shard. Beyond this hunt, return to a marked sealed site and protect your refuge."
msgstr "烧焦的军用石板上刻着古伦贝尔德的名字。披甲使徒只是第一形态；巨龙甲壳抵抗刀刃和热量，但不会再生。岩石可阻断集中的烈焰。最终击败他后，封闭熔炉北侧的伤口并领取碎片。此后回到已标记的封闭地点，保护自己的避难处。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld has fallen in his final form. Examine the exposed breach north of the crucible, then examine its sealed mark for the Flaming Carapace Shard. This closes only this stronghold's local wound; the Brand and existing demons remain."
msgstr "古伦贝尔德的最终形态已倒下。检查熔炉北侧的暴露裂隙，再检查封印标记领取烈焰甲壳碎片。这只会封闭要塞的当地伤口；烙印和已有恶魔仍然存在。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld is a late hunt. Seal the Count, Wyald and Rosine's breaches first, then consult the journal on the surface. Finish any ongoing escape from Flora before following this trail."
msgstr "古伦贝尔德属于后期狩猎。先封闭伯爵、瓦伊阿尔德和罗西妮的裂隙，再在地表查阅日志。如正在逃离芙罗拉的宅邸，请先完成逃脱。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld already died at Flora's grove. This stronghold contains his remaining wound, not a resurrected apostle. You can seal it; his old shard remains the unique reward, so the mark will not create another."
msgstr "古伦贝尔德已在芙罗拉的树林中死去。要塞里只剩他的伤口，不会复活使徒。你可以封闭它；旧的碎片仍是唯一奖励，封印不会再创造一件。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "The armor splits. Grunbeld becomes a dragon; this is the second and final form. Stone cover blocks the focused flame. The new body pauses briefly before attacking."
msgstr "铠甲裂开了。古伦贝尔德化为巨龙，这是第二也是最终形态。岩石掩体可以阻断集中的烈焰。新身体会在攻击前短暂停顿。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "The dragon form cannot emerge here. No victory or reward is recorded. Clear space near the fallen armored form; automatic retries are bounded. After they end, examine the crucible breach to retry."
msgstr "巨龙形态无法在此出现。不会记录胜利或奖励。清理倒下的铠甲形态附近的空间；自动重试次数有限。结束后检查熔炉裂隙可再次尝试。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld: dragon form"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德：巨龙形态"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "The armored apostle reveals his final body."
msgstr "披甲使徒显露最终的身体。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Armored apostle form"
msgstr "使徒铠甲形态"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "This body will change form at half health. A lethal hit to this form is not the end of the hunt."
msgstr "这个身体会在生命降至一半时改变形态。对它造成致命一击不会结束狩猎。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Final dragon form"
msgstr "最终巨龙形态"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "This is the final body. Its defeat exposes only its own stronghold breach."
msgstr "这是最终的身体。击败它只会暴露其要塞的裂隙。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Preparing a hammer sweep"
msgstr "正在准备战锤横扫"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld raises his hammer. Leave its reach or break the attack line with stone."
msgstr "古伦贝尔德举起战锤。离开攻击范围，或用岩石阻断攻击线。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Preparing focused flame"
msgstr "正在准备集中烈焰"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Heat gathers in the dragon's mouth. Move beyond six tiles or behind solid stone."
msgstr "热量在巨龙口中聚集。退到六格以外，或躲到坚固岩石后。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld, armored apostle"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德，披甲使徒"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "An armored giant carrying a heavy hammer. Grunbeld braces before a sweeping blow and becomes a dragon when this body is broken. He does not regenerate. Defeating this form does not award a relic or close the breach."
msgstr "手持重锤的披甲巨人。古伦贝尔德在横扫前蓄势，并在这个身体受挫时化为巨龙。他不会再生。击败此形态不会给予遗物或封闭裂隙。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld, flaming dragon"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德，烈焰巨龙"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld's final body, a great dragon clad in a fiery stone carapace. He gathers heat before a focused flame jet. Solid stone interrupts its line; distance buys time. The armor is formidable but the wounds do not regenerate."
msgstr "古伦贝尔德的最终身体，是披着烈焰石甲的巨龙。他在喷射集中的火焰前聚集热量。坚固岩石能阻断攻击线；拉开距离可以争取时间。甲壳坚固，但伤口不会再生。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld's hammer strikes you!"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德的战锤击中了你！"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld's hammer strikes %s!"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德的战锤击中了%s！"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld's hammer misses you!"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德的战锤未能击中你！"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld's hammer misses %s!"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德的战锤未能击中%s！"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld prepares his hammer! Break the line or leave its reach!"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德正在准备战锤！阻断攻击线或离开攻击范围！"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld's flame strikes you!"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德的烈焰击中了你！"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld's flame strikes %s!"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德的烈焰击中了%s！"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld's flame misses you!"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德的烈焰未能击中你！"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld's flame misses %s!"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德的烈焰未能击中%s！"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld prepares his flame! Break the line or leave its reach!"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德正在准备烈焰！阻断攻击线或离开攻击范围！"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld's exposed breach"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德的暴露裂隙"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld's sealed breach"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德的封闭裂隙"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld campaign tablet"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德的军用石板"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld stronghold — approach"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德要塞——入口"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld stronghold — ramparts"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德要塞——堡垒"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld stronghold — quarry"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德要塞——采石场"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld stronghold — barracks"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德要塞——兵营"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld stronghold — ruins"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德要塞——废墟"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Grunbeld stronghold — crucible"
msgstr "古伦贝尔德要塞——熔炉"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "All four named breaches are settled. Your first sealed breach is marked again. Recover in that quiet region, build your refuge and consult the journal to revisit any completed hunt. The Brand remains; this chapter ends with a place to return to."
msgstr "四处有名使徒的裂隙均已封闭。第一处封闭裂隙已重新标记。在其平静区域恢复，建造避难处，并用日志重访已完成的狩猎。烙印依然存在；这一章节以可归返之处结束。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "All four named breaches are settled. Use the journal to mark a known sealed lair, recover nearby and prepare your refuge. The Brand and demons elsewhere remain."
msgstr "四处有名使徒的裂隙均已封闭。用日志标记已封闭的巢穴，在附近恢复并准备避难处。烙印与其他地区的恶魔仍然存在。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Hunt record: Count <global_val:berserk_hunt_count_state>, Wyald <global_val:berserk_hunt_wyald_state>, Rosine <global_val:berserk_hunt_rosine_state>, Grunbeld <global_val:berserk_hunt_grunbeld_state>. 0 or blank = unknown; 1 = found; 2 = encounter; 3 = guardian defeated; 4 = breach closed; 5 = relic received. Each place has its own coordinates."
msgstr "狩猎记录：伯爵 <global_val:berserk_hunt_count_state>，瓦伊阿尔德 <global_val:berserk_hunt_wyald_state>，罗西妮 <global_val:berserk_hunt_rosine_state>，古伦贝尔德 <global_val:berserk_hunt_grunbeld_state>。0或空白=未知；1=已发现；2=遭遇开始；3=守卫被击败；4=裂隙已封闭；5=已领取遗物。每个地点有独立坐标。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Trace Grunbeld's scarred stronghold?"
msgstr "追踪古伦贝尔德残破的要塞？"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Remembered trails to the Count, Wyald, Rosine and Grunbeld. Activate to mark a known site or seek its unique lair after the first hunt. Grunbeld opens after the other three breaches are sealed. Every place has separate coordinates, progress and a one-time reward. No literacy or living guide is needed."
msgstr "记录通往伯爵、瓦伊阿尔德、罗西妮与古伦贝尔德的记忆。激活可标记已知地点，或在第一次狩猎后寻找其唯一巢穴。其他三处裂隙封闭后，古伦贝尔德的狩猎才会开放。每个地点都有独立坐标、进度与一次性奖励。无需识字，也无需向导在场。"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "\"Each apostle holds a separate wound. Seal the Count, Wyald and Rosine's breaches before seeking Grunbeld. His armored body is only the beginning; the dragon is his final form. Your journal marks each trail. Once all four are sealed, return to a quiet place and protect the living.\""
msgstr "“每个使徒都控制一处独立的伤口。先封闭伯爵、瓦伊阿尔德和罗西妮的裂隙，再寻找古伦贝尔德。他的披甲身体只是开始；巨龙才是最终形态。日志会标记每条线索。四处都封闭后，回到平静之地，保护活着的人。”"

#: mods/Berserk/grunbeld_hunt
msgid "Mark Grunbeld's stronghold."
msgstr "标记古伦贝尔德的要塞。"

#: mods/Berserk/monsters/apostle_grunbeld.json
msgid "The %s sheds its ruined armor!"
msgstr "%s褪去了破碎的铠甲！"

#: mods/Berserk/effects/flora_siege_eocs.json
msgid "The ward shudders. Grunbeld's fate is already recorded elsewhere; no second original appears at the eastern approach. Both escape paths remain open. Keep moving toward the western road or the southern garden."
msgstr "结界在颤抖。古伦贝尔德的命运已在别处记录；东面的入口不会出现第二个本体。两条逃生路线仍然开放。继续前往西边道路或南边花园。"

#: effects/arm_cannon_install_eocs.json
msgid "The arm cannon could not be installed. You keep the crafted cannon."
msgstr "无法安装机械臂炮。制作好的臂炮仍然保留。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "\"Keep the armor you already have; I will not issue another suit. If you agree, I will prepare an escape charm. The attack will begin only when you activate it here and confirm. Equip and pack first. Escape through the western road or southern garden, not through victory over both apostles.\""
msgstr "\"保留你已有的铠甲，我不会再给你一套。如果你同意，我会准备逃生护符。只有你在这里激活护符并确认，袭击才会开始。先穿好铠甲，收拾物资。从西侧道路或南侧花园逃离，无须击败两位使徒。\""

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "\"Questions and receiving armor do not commit you to battle. A separate readiness response prepares the charm, and its activation starts the attack. If you have not survived the Eclipse or are away from my manor, that preparation is unavailable.\""
msgstr "\"提问和领取铠甲并不意味着你必须参战。通过单独的准备对话取得护符，激活护符才会开始袭击。如果你尚未经历蚀，或不在我的庄园，这项准备就无法进行。\""

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "\"The escape has ended. Seek shelter and recover; your hunt journal can guide you to the remaining apostles. My gift remains yours, but the grove can no longer protect you.\""
msgstr "\"逃生已经结束。寻找庇护所恢复体力，狩猎日志会引导你寻找其余使徒。我的赠礼仍属于你，但这片树林再也无法保护你。\""

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "\"The sanctuary is lost, but your road continues. Recover, then follow the unfinished hunts. There will be no second attack on this house.\""
msgstr "\"庇护所已失，但你的旅途仍在继续。休养之后，继续未完成的狩猎。这座房屋不会再经历第二次袭击。\""

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "\"You have confirmed readiness. The charm waits for your decision; there is no attack clock yet. Return here with your equipment and activate it when ready.\""
msgstr "\"你已确认准备就绪。护符等待你的决定，袭击倒计时尚未开始。带好装备回到这里，准备好后再激活它。\""

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "*Flora turns to you and waits for you to speak."
msgstr "*芙萝拉转向你，等待你开口。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "Flora could not confirm readiness. Speak to her in the peaceful registered manor after surviving the Eclipse. You need either her armor gift or an existing complete or packed suit; an attack already begun cannot be prepared again."
msgstr "芙萝拉未能确认准备就绪。经历蚀后，在仍然平静的已登记庄园与她交谈。你需要领取她赠予的铠甲，或已有完整或打包的套装；已经开始的袭击无法再次准备。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "Flora's sanctuary has fallen. The escape is complete and the attack cannot be restarted. Recover at your refuge, then activate your apostle hunt journal to choose an unfinished trail."
msgstr "芙萝拉的庇护所已沦陷。逃生已经完成，袭击无法重启。回到自己的庇护所休养，然后激活使徒狩猎日志，选择尚未完成的追猎。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "Flora's token for a one-time escape. First speak to her in her manor and explicitly confirm readiness; receiving or wearing armor alone is not enough. An existing complete or packed suit has its own readiness response. Equip and pack before activating this charm in the registered manor. A confirmation starts the attack: guardians delay Zodd and Grunbeld while you escape through the western road or southern garden. It needs no power, does not teleport you and cannot restart a completed attack."
msgstr "芙萝拉为一次逃生准备的护符。首先在庄园与她交谈，明确确认准备就绪；仅仅领取或穿戴铠甲并不够。已有完整或打包套装时，请选择铠甲持有者的专属准备选项。激活护符前，在已登记的庄园穿好铠甲并整理装备。确认后袭击开始：守护者拖延佐德和古伦贝鲁多，让你从西侧道路或南侧花园逃离。护符无需能源，不会传送你，也无法重启已结束的袭击。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "I already have the armor. Help me prepare for the attack."
msgstr "我已经有铠甲了。帮我准备应对袭击。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "I understand. Confirm my readiness and give me the escape charm."
msgstr "我明白。确认我已准备就绪，并给我逃生护符。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "Let us speak."
msgstr "我们谈谈吧。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "Not now."
msgstr "现在不了。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "Readiness has not been confirmed. Speak to Flora and explicitly agree to prepare the attack. If you already have the armor, choose the armor-owner readiness response. Merely receiving or wearing armor is not enough."
msgstr "尚未确认准备就绪。与芙萝拉交谈，明确同意准备应对袭击。如果已有铠甲，请选择铠甲持有者的专属准备选项。仅仅领取或穿戴铠甲并不够。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "Readiness is confirmed and Flora gives you an escape charm. Your existing armor is kept; missing pieces are entrusted only once. Equip and pack what you need, then activate the charm inside her manor. The attack waits for your explicit confirmation. Escape by the western road or southern garden; you need not kill the apostles."
msgstr "准备就绪已确认，芙萝拉交给你逃生护符。保留已有的铠甲，缺少的部件只赠予一次。穿好铠甲，收拾物资，然后在庄园内激活护符。袭击等待你的明确确认。从西侧道路或南侧花园逃离，无须杀死使徒。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "Readiness is confirmed. Equip and pack what you need, then activate Flora's escape charm inside the registered manor. Until you confirm activation, the attack does not begin."
msgstr "准备就绪已确认。穿好铠甲、整理物资，然后在已登记的庄园内激活芙萝拉的逃生护符。在你确认激活之前，袭击不会开始。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "Speak to Flora in her manor. You can ask questions and receive the missing armor without beginning an attack. Readiness requires a separate dialogue confirmation."
msgstr "在庄园与芙萝拉交谈。你可以提问并领取缺少的铠甲，而不开始袭击。准备就绪需要通过单独的对话确认。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "The attack has already begun. Leave through the western road or southern garden and go beyond the grove; the charm cannot restart it."
msgstr "袭击已经开始。从西侧道路或南侧花园逃离，并走出树林；护符无法重启袭击。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "The attack on Flora's manor is underway. Leave by the western road or the southern garden, then go beyond the grove."
msgstr "芙萝拉的庄园正在遭受袭击。从西侧道路或南侧花园逃离，然后走出树林。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "The escape is already complete. Flora's manor has fallen; this charm cannot start the attack again."
msgstr "逃生已经完成。芙萝拉的庄园已沦陷，这枚护符无法再次开始袭击。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "The manor has not been registered. Begin a conversation with Flora in her manor, then try the charm again."
msgstr "庄园尚未登记。在她的庄园开始与芙萝拉交谈，然后再尝试激活护符。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "The manor is not in its peaceful preparation state. Speak to Flora before trying again."
msgstr "庄园当前不处于平静的准备阶段。再次尝试之前，请先与芙萝拉交谈。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "What is the next step in our plan?"
msgstr "我们的计划下一步是什么？"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "You are outside the registered manor. Return to Flora's house or its southern gardens, then activate the charm when ready."
msgstr "你不在准备袭击时登记的庄园。回到芙萝拉的房屋或南侧花园，准备好后再激活护符。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "You have already resolved the armor gift. To prepare the attack, speak to Flora and choose the separate readiness response for an armor owner. Receiving or wearing the armor does not confirm readiness."
msgstr "铠甲赠礼已经处理完毕。要准备袭击，请与芙萝拉交谈，选择铠甲持有者的专属准备选项。领取或穿戴铠甲不会确认准备就绪。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "You must survive the Eclipse before preparing Flora's attack. The charm does nothing for now."
msgstr "你必须先从蚀中幸存，才能准备芙萝拉的袭击。护符暂时不起作用。"

#: dialogue/flora.json effects/flora_eocs.json effects/flora_siege_eocs.json items/flora_escape_charm.json
msgid "You postpone the attack. Readiness remains confirmed; activate the charm again when your preparations are complete."
msgstr "你暂缓了袭击。准备就绪的状态仍然保留，完成准备后可以再次激活护符。"

#: missions/first_hunt.json effects/first_hunt_eocs.json items/first_hunt_directions.json dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "First hunt: the apostle's hollow"
msgstr "首次狩猎：使徒的巢穴"

#: missions/first_hunt.json effects/first_hunt_eocs.json items/first_hunt_directions.json dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Find the apostle in the marked forest hollow and defeat it. Recover from the Eclipse and prepare a ward and your equipment before approaching. After victory, search its remains for a burned scrap and activate the scrap to trace a nearby breach. The mission does not require the Skull Knight to remain nearby."
msgstr "在标记的林间巢穴找到并击败使徒。接近之前，先从蚀中恢复，准备护符和装备。获胜后搜索遗骸，拾取烧焦的纸片并激活它，追查附近的裂隙。完成任务不需要骷髅骑士留在身边。"

#: missions/first_hunt.json effects/first_hunt_eocs.json items/first_hunt_directions.json dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "first-hunt notes"
msgstr "首次狩猎笔记"

#: missions/first_hunt.json effects/first_hunt_eocs.json items/first_hunt_directions.json dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "The Skull Knight's first trail after the Eclipse. Activate to recover the same hunt target or retry a failed search after travelling. Track the hollow through the missions menu; the notes never create a second lair after a target has been recorded. After victory, they remind you to collect and activate the burned scrap. No living guide or literacy is needed."
msgstr "蚀之后骷髅骑士指出的第一条线索。激活可重新显示同一个狩猎目标，或在旅行后重试失败的搜索。通过任务菜单追踪巢穴；目标一旦记录，笔记就不会创建第二个巢穴。获胜后，它会提醒你拾取并激活烧焦的纸片。无需识字，也无需活着的向导。"

#: missions/first_hunt.json effects/first_hunt_eocs.json items/first_hunt_directions.json dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Recall the first hunt"
msgstr "回想首次狩猎"

#: missions/first_hunt.json effects/first_hunt_eocs.json items/first_hunt_directions.json dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "First hunt added to your missions: the apostle's hollow. Its target is the marked forest hollow. Recover, prepare a ward and your equipment, then follow the mission marker. Search the apostle's remains for a burned scrap after the battle."
msgstr "任务日志已添加“首次狩猎：使徒的巢穴”。目标是标记的林间巢穴。先恢复身体，准备护符与装备，再沿任务标记前进。战斗后搜索使徒遗骸，寻找烧焦的纸片。"

#: missions/first_hunt.json effects/first_hunt_eocs.json items/first_hunt_directions.json dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Your saved hunt location could not be verified. It has been kept unchanged; no replacement lair or duplicate mission was created. Check the save and report this message."
msgstr "无法验证已保存的狩猎地点。原坐标保持不变，没有创建替代巢穴或重复任务。请检查存档并报告此消息。"

#: missions/first_hunt.json effects/first_hunt_eocs.json items/first_hunt_directions.json dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "No safe forest hollow was found 8-16 overmap tiles away. No hunt has been assigned. Search retries at most three times here; travel at least 24 local tiles and activate your first-hunt notes to try from another position. Explored terrain is never replaced."
msgstr "未能在距离8–16格大地图的位置找到安全的林间巢穴，尚未分配狩猎任务。此处最多重试三次；移动至少24格普通地图距离，然后激活首次狩猎笔记，从新位置搜索。已探索地形不会被替换。"

#: missions/first_hunt.json effects/first_hunt_eocs.json items/first_hunt_directions.json dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "The first hunt still points to the same hollow. Select \"First hunt: the apostle's hollow\" in your missions menu to track it on the overmap. Other hunts keep their own progress."
msgstr "首次狩猎仍然指向同一个巢穴。在任务菜单中选择“首次狩猎：使徒的巢穴”，即可在大地图上追踪目标。其他狩猎保持各自的进度。"

#: missions/first_hunt.json effects/first_hunt_eocs.json items/first_hunt_directions.json dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "First hunt completed. Search the apostle's remains, take the burned scrap and activate it to locate the nearby breach. You do not need the Skull Knight to continue."
msgstr "首次狩猎已完成。搜索使徒遗骸，拾取烧焦的纸片并激活它，寻找附近的裂隙。继续旅程不需要骷髅骑士。"

#: missions/first_hunt.json effects/first_hunt_eocs.json items/first_hunt_directions.json dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Survive the Eclipse and return to the surface before following the first hunt."
msgstr "先从蚀中幸存并回到地表，再开始首次狩猎。"

#: missions/first_hunt.json effects/first_hunt_eocs.json items/first_hunt_directions.json dialogue/skull_knight.json
msgid "Remind me where the first hunt leads."
msgstr "提醒我，首次狩猎通往哪里？"
